<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.800" end="00:00:03.600" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.000" end="00:00:05.100" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll pull Julian&#39;s billionaire boss</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.600" end="00:00:06.100" style="s2">over to my side. I&#39;ve seen this movie.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.100" end="00:00:07.900" style="s2">It&#39;s about a man who becomes a</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.100" end="00:00:09.300" style="s2">superstar. Bad news, I&#39;m the unlucky guy</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.900" end="00:00:10.900" style="s2">in it. My boyfriend steals the alpha</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.300" end="00:00:12.400" style="s2">heat relief perfume formula I developed,</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.900" end="00:00:15.500" style="s2">gives it to Julian, developed under the</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.400" end="00:00:17.300" style="s2">name of his childhood friend Julian,</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.500" end="00:00:19.100" style="s2">then dumps me. It all started before</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.300" end="00:00:21.700" style="s2">tonight&#39;s launch when I woke up and</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.100" end="00:00:23.300" style="s2">realized I had entered this movie. Wait,</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.700" end="00:00:25.500" style="s2">I&#39;m a straight man. How did I end up</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.300" end="00:00:27.800" style="s2">inside a movie and become a male Omega?</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.500" end="00:00:30.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at our genius perfumer</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.800" end="00:00:32.000" style="s2">reduced to handing out samples now?</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.400" end="00:00:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just a junior researcher. You</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.000" end="00:00:34.400" style="s2">really think you have the right to stand</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.000" end="00:00:36.100" style="s2">on that stage? Still waiting for Evan to</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.400" end="00:00:37.600" style="s2">stand up for you? He&#39;s in the VIP lounge</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:40.000" style="s2">with Julian and he doesn&#39;t have time for</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.600" end="00:00:41.800" style="s2">you. Evan wants your formula, not you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.000" end="00:00:43.000" style="s2">Don&#39;t confuse the two.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.800" end="00:00:43.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re the one who changed the name</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.000" end="00:00:44.900" style="s2">for Evan?</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.700" end="00:00:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, so what?</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.900" end="00:00:51.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Know your place. Apologize and I&#39;ll let</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:52.000" style="s2">you stay for the launch.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.100" end="00:00:53.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.000" end="00:00:55.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you want everyone to see where I</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.400" end="00:00:57.600" style="s2">belong?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.600" end="00:00:58.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn off his microphone. Are you crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.600" end="00:01:01.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not so pleasant being watched by</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.900" end="00:01:03.500" style="s2">everyone, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.000" end="00:01:05.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, you</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.500" end="00:01:07.200" style="s2">Who&#39;s this getting a welcome like that?</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.500" end="00:01:09.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are Adrian Vale&#39;s bodyguards. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.200" end="00:01:12.800" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:14.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vale, why would he come here?</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.800" end="00:01:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, these are Julian&#39;s guests. They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.400" end="00:01:17.300" style="s2">waiting for the perfume launch to begin.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:19.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One look from him and the whole room</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.300" end="00:01:20.400" style="s2">goes quiet. He&#39;s Adrian Vale, the</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.000" end="00:01:21.700" style="s2">billionaire villain in the movie. If I</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.400" end="00:01:22.600" style="s2">catch his eye, maybe I won&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.700" end="00:01:25.000" style="s2">die.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.600" end="00:01:26.700" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.000" end="00:01:27.600" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll pull Julian&#39;s billionaire boss</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.700" end="00:01:30.300" style="s2">over to my side.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.600" end="00:01:30.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened here?</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.700" end="00:01:33.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before you came in, he was still trying</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.000" end="00:01:35.700" style="s2">to hit me. I don&#39;t want to walk past him</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.500" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">alone. Terrified of him. If anyone can</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.700" end="00:01:40.200" style="s2">keep me alive in this movie, it&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.000" end="00:01:41.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vale, we came with Julian. What just</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.200" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">happened was a small misunderstanding,</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.800" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">nothing serious.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.000" end="00:01:46.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vale, your seat is ready. Should we</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.300" end="00:01:50.500" style="s2">go over?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.900" end="00:01:50.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You go ahead. I&#39;ll be there shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:53.100" style="s2">You&#39;re still here because of him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.900" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before you came in, he was still trying</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.100" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">to hit me. I don&#39;t want to walk past him</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:57.200" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.000" end="00:01:58.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of pity play hasn&#39;t he seen?</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.200" end="00:02:00.100" style="s2">If I overdo it, he&#39;ll think I approached</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.900" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">him deliberately.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.100" end="00:02:01.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.492" end="00:02:02.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to witness that. Thank you for stopping</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.992" end="00:02:04.192" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.792" end="00:02:06.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.192" end="00:02:06.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah Reed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.792" end="00:02:10.292" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know you&#39;d be here tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.292" end="00:02:11.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; how the launch was going.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.292" end="00:02:12.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those guests are industry people. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.392" end="00:02:12.892" style="s2">thought inviting them could help promote</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.392" end="00:02:14.492" style="s2">the perfume.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.892" end="00:02:16.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time invite people who know how to</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.492" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">behave.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.392" end="00:02:19.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. It won&#39;t happen again.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:20.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car is waiting. Leave the rest of</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.892" end="00:02:21.992" style="s2">the staff.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.992" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.992" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">Good night.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.592" end="00:02:27.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Noah?</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.292" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably left. Blake said he took the</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.892" end="00:02:30.692" style="s2">microphone and caused a scene in front</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.092" end="00:02:31.892" style="s2">of everyone. I just hope Mr. Vale didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.692" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">hear all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.892" end="00:02:36.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell was he doing tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.892" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for dinner and for the</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.192" end="00:02:39.192" style="s2">clothes. They fit perfectly.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.992" end="00:02:41.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.192" end="00:02:42.792" style="s2">Someone is eager to reach you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.492" end="00:02:44.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blake wasn&#39;t in such a hurry when he</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.792" end="00:02:45.692" style="s2">came after me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:46.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer it. Better than letting it ring</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.692" end="00:02:47.892" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.392" end="00:02:49.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you? You embarrassed Blake,</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.892" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">upset Julia, and dragged Adrian Vale</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:51.792" style="s2">into it. You owe them an apology. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.792" end="00:02:55.592" style="s2">even know who Vale is?</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.792" end="00:02:55.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian&#39;s boss, the owner of this hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.092" end="00:02:58.292" style="s2">No, I&#39;m here to end this for good. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.792" end="00:02:59.492" style="s2">over, Evan.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.292" end="00:03:00.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is the head of the Vale group. Make him</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.492" end="00:03:01.292" style="s2">angry and you&#39;ll never work in this</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.592" end="00:03:02.492" style="s2">industry again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.292" end="00:03:03.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan, do you really know him or do you</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.492" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">just repeat whatever Julian says?</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.792" end="00:03:05.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your boyfriend. Watch how you speak</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:06.592" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.292" end="00:03:08.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why were you helping Julian take</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.592" end="00:03:08.392" style="s2">credit for my work while I faced Blake</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.092" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">alone?</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.392" end="00:03:10.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you go again. You&#39;re dragging</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.492" end="00:03:12.392" style="s2">Julian into this again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.692" end="00:03:13.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m here to end this for good. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.392" end="00:03:14.592" style="s2">over, Evan, and I&#39;m not working for you</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.692" end="00:03:15.792" style="s2">for free anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.592" end="00:03:17.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made sure I heard every word.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.792" end="00:03:18.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. I shouldn&#39;t have made you listen</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.292" end="00:03:20.592" style="s2">to him say those awful things.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.892" end="00:03:22.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to apologize for him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.592" end="00:03:23.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll just say thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.692" end="00:03:24.792" style="s2">Thank you for dinner and for taking care</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.992" end="00:03:25.792" style="s2">of me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.792" end="00:03:29.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you getting home?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.792" end="00:03:30.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;ll call a car. Good night, Mr. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.192" end="00:03:34.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $18.64.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.992" end="00:03:35.892" style="s2">Seriously? The ride alone costs $46. I</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.192" end="00:03:37.292" style="s2">spent it all on perfume and Evan and</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.892" end="00:03:38.692" style="s2">didn&#39;t even leave myself enough to get</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.292" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">home. I walked out acting like</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.692" end="00:03:42.092" style="s2">everything was fine. Now what? Do I</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.492" end="00:03:44.292" style="s2">swallow my pride and go back in to ask</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.092" end="00:03:47.792" style="s2">for cab fare?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.292" end="00:03:47.792" style="s2">All right. Pride can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.292" end="00:03:50.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened? You looked pretty happy</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.392" end="00:03:51.892" style="s2">when you left.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.292" end="00:03:52.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah broke up with me. He blocked my</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.892" end="00:03:54.192" style="s2">number too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.492" end="00:03:55.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let him go. Evan, I&#39;m investing in</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.192" end="00:03:57.092" style="s2">your career. What you need is</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.492" end="00:03:59.492" style="s2">connections, not a boyfriend who makes</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.092" end="00:04:00.692" style="s2">you lose face.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.492" end="00:04:03.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know,</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.692" end="00:04:04.694" style="s2">but But the one who pursued me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.092" end="00:04:07.894" style="s2">He whatever I told him to do. He</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.694" end="00:04:07.894" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t be reacting like this.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.294" end="00:04:14.094" style="s2">Could you help steady my hand? This is</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.194" end="00:04:15.294" style="s2">awkward. My card won&#39;t cover the fare.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.094" end="00:04:17.694" style="s2">Could you lend me a little? The fare is</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.294" end="00:04:19.094" style="s2">$46. I only have $18.64.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.694" end="00:04:20.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you headed? The studio.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.094" end="00:04:21.194" style="s2">Marcus, get Mr. Reed a car.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.294" end="00:04:22.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve really bailed me out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.194" end="00:04:24.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nothing. You</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.894" end="00:04:26.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn. Was wasn&#39;t borrowing cab fare</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.594" end="00:04:27.994" style="s2">embarrassing enough? Now I&#39;ve cut my</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.194" end="00:04:29.494" style="s2">hand right in front of him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.994" end="00:04:30.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Please, go on.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.494" end="00:04:32.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.694" end="00:04:34.194" style="s2">Let&#39;s take care of your hand first.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.694" end="00:04:36.394" style="s2">Do you need someone to help you or would</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.194" end="00:04:37.994" style="s2">you rather do it yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.394" end="00:04:39.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can handle it myself. Warm water,</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.994" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">plain soap, and a bandage. Please,</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.894" end="00:04:43.194" style="s2">nothing scented. Okay, that&#39;s better.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:43.794" style="s2">Nobody laughed at me. I can relax a</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.194" end="00:04:45.694" style="s2">little now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.794" end="00:04:46.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You even had them find unscented soap. I</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.694" end="00:04:48.494" style="s2">didn&#39;t think you&#39;d remember. Julian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.794" end="00:04:50.194" style="s2">afraid of this man for a reason. If he&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.494" end="00:04:51.694" style="s2">let me stay close, maybe I could avoid</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.194" end="00:04:53.294" style="s2">what happens to me in the movie. On</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.694" end="00:04:55.194" style="s2">screen, he&#39;s a villain nobody wants to</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.294" end="00:04:56.494" style="s2">cross. But sitting here, he doesn&#39;t seem</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.194" end="00:04:57.594" style="s2">so hard to get along with.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.494" end="00:04:58.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe he&#39;s simply being especially</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.594" end="00:04:59.594" style="s2">considerate towards me tonight. I still</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.994" end="00:05:00.494" style="s2">can&#39;t tell.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.594" end="00:05:01.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really have to go back to the</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.494" end="00:05:02.594" style="s2">studio tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.194" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I just thought I&#39;d already imposed</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.594" end="00:05:04.494" style="s2">long enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:05.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your room is still available. Stay until</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.494" end="00:05:06.794" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.494" end="00:05:07.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll accept your kindness.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.794" end="00:05:08.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re taking a risk on someone you</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.894" end="00:05:11.294" style="s2">barely know.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.994" end="00:05:13.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what it feels like to be used.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.294" end="00:05:15.894" style="s2">This doesn&#39;t feel like that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.794" end="00:05:17.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vale, your car is waiting outside.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.894" end="00:05:20.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.694" end="00:05:20.894" style="s2">Could you help steady my hand?</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.694" end="00:05:26.894" style="s2">I was the one who asked him to touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.194" end="00:05:28.594" style="s2">So why am I suddenly tuning him He</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.894" end="00:05:30.094" style="s2">stopped what he was doing. Maybe he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.594" end="00:05:32.194" style="s2">willing to help me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.094" end="00:05:33.594" style="s2">Even if I&#39;ve misread him, I can&#39;t back</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.194" end="00:05:34.794" style="s2">down now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.594" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you really want isn&#39;t just a</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.794" end="00:05:39.794" style="s2">bandage, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.094" end="00:05:39.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it weren&#39;t, would you still help me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.594" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">Relax. Let me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.894" end="00:05:50.094" style="s2">I was the one who asked him to touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.394" end="00:05:51.494" style="s2">So why am I suddenly too embarrassed to</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.094" end="00:05:53.094" style="s2">even look at him?</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.494" end="00:05:53.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bandaging is only an excuse. We both</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.094" end="00:05:54.994" style="s2">know that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.694" end="00:05:56.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t trying to deceive you. I just</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.994" end="00:05:57.094" style="s2">don&#39;t want you to forget me as soon as I</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.194" end="00:05:58.194" style="s2">leave tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.094" end="00:05:59.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to think of you after you</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.194" end="00:06:01.894" style="s2">leave.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.894" end="00:06:03.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Mr. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.894" end="00:06:03.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get some sleep first. We&#39;ll talk</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.194" end="00:06:05.495" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.794" end="00:06:07.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Other people always asked me out. I &#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.495" end="00:06:09.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; never pursued anyone so boldly. Was that</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.495" end="00:06:10.995" style="s2">too much just now? I have to survive</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.295" end="00:06:12.695" style="s2">first. He&#39;s the only person who might</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.995" end="00:06:14.664" style="s2">protect me. I can&#39;t give up just because</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.695" end="00:06:16.684" style="s2">I lost a little dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.664" end="00:06:16.684" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.095" end="00:06:20.695" style="s2">I plan to keep him thinking about me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.395" end="00:06:24.195" style="s2">How am I the one lying in bed with</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.695" end="00:06:24.195" style="s2">nothing but him on my mind now?</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.495" end="00:06:27.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I look into Mr. Reed? That should</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.995" end="00:06:28.795" style="s2">have been done already. Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.495" end="00:06:29.995" style="s2">Replace that zipper. Contact our regular</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.795" end="00:06:31.095" style="s2">jeweler and have a few men&#39;s watches</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.995" end="00:06:32.395" style="s2">brought over tomorrow morning. Keep the</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.095" end="00:06:34.695" style="s2">style simple. Nothing too bulky.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.395" end="00:06:34.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.995" end="00:06:38.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s $180,000. We only met last night.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.095" end="00:06:40.195" style="s2">I can&#39;t just accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.395" end="00:06:41.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He had this repaired overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.195" end="00:06:44.195" style="s2">The movies never showed how thoughtful</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.695" end="00:06:44.195" style="s2">he could be.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.695" end="00:06:48.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Mr. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.495" end="00:06:48.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning, Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.595" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pick one you like and wear it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.295" end="00:06:55.695" style="s2">This one is enough. This was the one you</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:57.095" style="s2">noticed first. Don&#39;t choose the cheaper</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.695" end="00:06:59.595" style="s2">one just to be polite.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.095" end="00:07:00.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s $180,000. We only met last night.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.595" end="00:07:02.195" style="s2">I can&#39;t just accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.895" end="00:07:02.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can afford to give you a watch you truly</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.195" end="00:07:04.695" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.895" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to get the strap adjusted. Will</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.695" end="00:07:06.495" style="s2">you come with me?</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.495" end="00:07:07.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to see me, you don&#39;t need to</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.495" end="00:07:09.295" style="s2">find an excuse. Just come directly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.895" end="00:07:11.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will. Next time, let me do something</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.295" end="00:07:11.595" style="s2">for you too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.295" end="00:07:17.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save this number.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.795" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">Call this number directly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.595" end="00:07:22.295" style="s2">If you need anything, call me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:23.495" style="s2">I know you&#39;re busy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.295" end="00:07:25.395" style="s2">I won&#39;t keep bothering you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.495" end="00:07:27.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I can&#39;t keep bothering him, but I</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.395" end="00:07:28.695" style="s2">can&#39;t just disappear without a trace. If</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.395" end="00:07:30.595" style="s2">I call too often, it&#39;ll look like I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.695" end="00:07:32.195" style="s2">trying too hard to curry favor. But if I</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.595" end="00:07:35.095" style="s2">stay completely silent, he&#39;ll forget all</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.195" end="00:07:35.095" style="s2">about me in no time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.895" end="00:07:40.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to catch a flight.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.395" end="00:07:42.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A car will take you back to the studio.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.295" end="00:07:42.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have a safe trip.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.395" end="00:07:50.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who comes to a perfume showcase in a car</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.095" end="00:07:50.695" style="s2">like that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.895" end="00:07:56.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a custom-built luxury limousine.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.995" end="00:07:59.695" style="s2">And he&#39;s using it to take me to work.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.395" end="00:07:59.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, please get in.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.995" end="00:08:06.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They can&#39;t have made more than a handful</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.195" end="00:08:06.997" style="s2">of these.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.895" end="00:08:09.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.997" end="00:08:10.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to order one, you have to be invited</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.297" end="00:08:12.197" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.297" end="00:08:14.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who comes to a perfume showcase in a car</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.197" end="00:08:15.997" style="s2">like that?</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.497" end="00:08:18.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan could sell the whole company and</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.997" end="00:08:18.997" style="s2">still not afford this car.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.297" end="00:08:24.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.597" end="00:08:26.197" style="s2">That&#39;s Noah Reed.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.297" end="00:08:28.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t he work here? Since when does he</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.197" end="00:08:29.497" style="s2">have that kind of money?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.397" end="00:08:30.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.497" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">you&#39;d better have an explanation for</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.897" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.497" end="00:08:39.697" style="s2">Pack your things. Come with me. No,</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.497" end="00:08:40.997" style="s2">these people are still waiting. You</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.697" end="00:08:42.197" style="s2">should leave.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.997" end="00:08:45.097" style="s2">Telling him I&#39;ve arrived wouldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.197" end="00:08:45.097" style="s2">bothering him, would it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.497" end="00:08:48.597" style="s2">Still busy?</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.697" end="00:08:50.797" style="s2">Or hasn&#39;t he seen it?</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.597" end="00:08:52.397" style="s2">In one word, he saw it,</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.797" end="00:08:55.097" style="s2">but he didn&#39;t leave me much room to</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.397" end="00:08:55.097" style="s2">respond.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.797" end="00:08:59.497" style="s2">At least he replied.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.697" end="00:09:02.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bought the sample box. May I ask you</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.497" end="00:09:04.697" style="s2">something? You&#39;re a perfumer, right?</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.097" end="00:09:06.097" style="s2">This one can ease an alpha&#39;s heat, but</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.697" end="00:09:08.397" style="s2">nobody wants to use it because of the</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.097" end="00:09:10.697" style="s2">smell. Can you adjust it?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.397" end="00:09:12.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see how you change it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.697" end="00:09:14.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can try, but I&#39;ve never used this</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.897" end="00:09:16.697" style="s2">formula before.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.497" end="00:09:18.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s okay. Take a look first, then</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.697" end="00:09:22.097" style="s2">give it a try. He kept the ingredients</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.897" end="00:09:23.997" style="s2">that work and removed the harsh smell.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.097" end="00:09:27.197" style="s2">Now it eases discomfort without making</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:29.397" style="s2">you want to wash it off right away.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.197" end="00:09:31.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, pack your things. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.397" end="00:09:32.297" style="s2">No, these people are still waiting. You</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.197" end="00:09:33.797" style="s2">should leave.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.297" end="00:09:35.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose car brought you here this morning?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.797" end="00:09:37.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to question me about that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.997" end="00:09:39.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan, I&#39;ve already broken up with you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.797" end="00:09:41.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They already said they broke up. Why is</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.397" end="00:09:42.897" style="s2">this guy still acting like he owns Noah?</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.197" end="00:09:45.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s good-looking enough, but next to</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.897" end="00:09:46.697" style="s2">Noah, he doesn&#39;t even compare. Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.097" end="00:09:48.097" style="s2">build-wise, I look better in a shirt</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.697" end="00:09:49.697" style="s2">than he does.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come outside and talk to me alone for 2</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.697" end="00:09:53.097" style="s2">minutes. I want to hear your</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.997" end="00:09:54.297" style="s2">explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.097" end="00:09:55.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever you have to say can wait until</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.297" end="00:09:56.197" style="s2">I&#39;m done. I&#39;m not leaving these people</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.697" end="00:09:58.497" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.197" end="00:09:58.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah!</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.297" end="00:10:03.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let you barge in here and make a</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.597" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">scene?</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.197" end="00:10:05.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my boyfriend. This is between us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.797" end="00:10:07.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.697" end="00:10:08.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Bell, he&#39;s my ex-boyfriend. I broke</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.697" end="00:10:09.597" style="s2">up with him last night.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.897" end="00:10:10.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He already knew.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.597" end="00:10:11.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.198" end="00:10:13.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; calm down and come back to me</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.598" end="00:10:15.898" style="s2">obediently. Now, in front of a whole</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.998" end="00:10:17.098" style="s2">room of people, he&#39;s saying he dumped</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.898" end="00:10:19.698" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:21.098" style="s2">He&#39;s turned me into a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.698" end="00:10:22.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has no obligation to speak with you</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.098" end="00:10:24.598" style="s2">alone, and his refusal doesn&#39;t give you</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.898" end="00:10:26.998" style="s2">the right to take his phone. You&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.598" end="00:10:28.798" style="s2">as a professional, then act like one.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.998" end="00:10:29.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve misunderstood. I wasn&#39;t harassing</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.798" end="00:10:31.998" style="s2">him. I just wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.898" end="00:10:35.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What company are you with? Who arranged</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.998" end="00:10:35.298" style="s2">for you to attend this event?</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.698" end="00:10:38.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still have a presentation coming up</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.298" end="00:10:40.898" style="s2">and buyers to meet. I can&#39;t let this</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.798" end="00:10:42.298" style="s2">follow me around. If anyone complains</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.898" end="00:10:44.898" style="s2">that I&#39;ve been harassing my ex, the</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.298" end="00:10:46.398" style="s2">whole industry will know.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.898" end="00:10:47.898" style="s2">He thinks he can humiliate me and act</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.398" end="00:10:50.598" style="s2">like like nothing happened.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.898" end="00:10:50.598" style="s2">He&#39;ll regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.198" end="00:10:57.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This happened at an event I&#39;m hosting.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.998" end="00:10:57.198" style="s2">I&#39;m not going to let it go.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.898" end="00:11:02.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on, call Adam. I&#39;m his best shot at</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.398" end="00:11:03.698" style="s2">landing the next major retailer. He</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.498" end="00:11:06.998" style="s2">won&#39;t throw away that chance just</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.698" end="00:11:06.998" style="s2">because my ex made a scene.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.798" end="00:11:11.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.398" end="00:11:14.098" style="s2">I&#39;m in the young brands program.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.498" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">The person in charge is Adam Ridley.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.098" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">Give him a call.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.898" end="00:11:21.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll regret not coming out with me</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.998" end="00:11:21.698" style="s2">when I asked you to.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.598" end="00:11:26.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you write it all down?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.898" end="00:11:28.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.698" end="00:11:30.098" style="s2">I wrote it all down.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.598" end="00:11:31.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back to work without worrying. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.098" end="00:11:33.298" style="s2">make sure the people responsible here</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.498" end="00:11:34.998" style="s2">about this. If you ever need help at a</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.298" end="00:11:35.698" style="s2">showcase, just call me. I&#39;d be happy to</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.998" end="00:11:39.198" style="s2">come.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.698" end="00:11:39.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll hold you to that.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.858" end="00:11:42.878" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.998" end="00:11:51.398" style="s2">A formula alone isn&#39;t enough.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.198" end="00:11:53.498" style="s2">You need to know what every slight</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.398" end="00:11:54.898" style="s2">adjustment changes, and you have to be</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.498" end="00:11:58.398" style="s2">able to produce the same result</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.898" end="00:12:00.898" style="s2">consistently every time.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.398" end="00:12:02.998" style="s2">The original Noah really was talented.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.898" end="00:12:05.898" style="s2">These records are solid, and I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.998" end="00:12:07.898" style="s2">forgotten how to blend perfume myself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.898" end="00:12:10.698" style="s2">But adjusting the scent this morning was</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.898" end="00:12:13.698" style="s2">familiar work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.698" end="00:12:17.199" style="s2">And Alpha&#39;s heat wasn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.698" end="00:12:20.799" style="s2">In world, nothing like that existed.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.199" end="00:12:22.299" style="s2">The later tests weren&#39;t finished either.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.799" end="00:12:24.599" style="s2">Looks like he spent more time keeping</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.299" end="00:12:26.399" style="s2">Evans&#39; business going than he did on his</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.599" end="00:12:28.499" style="s2">own work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.399" end="00:12:30.099" style="s2">I need Adrian&#39;s help, but if he ever</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.499" end="00:12:31.699" style="s2">stops answering my calls, I can&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.099" end="00:12:33.799" style="s2">left with nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.699" end="00:12:35.799" style="s2">I have to show him what I can do, not</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.799" end="00:12:37.199" style="s2">just what I need, so I&#39;d better get to</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.799" end="00:12:39.199" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.199" end="00:12:41.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The buyer likes the product, but doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.199" end="00:12:42.299" style="s2">want to order a whole case of the same</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.199" end="00:12:44.199" style="s2">scent.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.299" end="00:12:46.299" style="s2">How do we keep this order without</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.199" end="00:12:48.799" style="s2">lowering the price?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.299" end="00:12:48.799" style="s2">Come on, Evan.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.499" end="00:12:53.799" style="s2">Right.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.299" end="00:12:54.899" style="s2">The order total stays the same, but the</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.799" end="00:12:56.499" style="s2">buyer doesn&#39;t have to put all their</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.899" end="00:12:58.599" style="s2">money into one scent. First, find out</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.499" end="00:13:00.768" style="s2">why the customer isn&#39;t buying, then</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.599" end="00:13:01.699" style="s2">decide whether to give up any margin.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.768" end="00:13:03.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.699" end="00:13:04.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, that really is clever. He does</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.199" end="00:13:07.899" style="s2">know how to sell things. I wonder Julian</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.899" end="00:13:07.899" style="s2">supports him so much.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.899" end="00:13:16.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s more like it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.399" end="00:13:18.199" style="s2">This is what I do best.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.299" end="00:13:20.299" style="s2">I know how to sell products. That&#39;s why</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.199" end="00:13:22.999" style="s2">they need me. Bell can lecture me all he</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.299" end="00:13:25.799" style="s2">wants. He doesn&#39;t understand my value.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.999" end="00:13:25.799" style="s2">Neither does Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.299" end="00:13:33.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened between you and Lewis</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.299" end="00:13:35.399" style="s2">Bell? Why did he call me about you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.499" end="00:13:36.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because he&#39;s overreacting. I just wanted</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.399" end="00:13:38.499" style="s2">to talk to my boyfriend. Bell came out,</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.799" end="00:13:39.899" style="s2">scolded me, and insisted on telling you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:40.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your boyfriend, Noah the perfumer?</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.899" end="00:13:42.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s just mad at me. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.999" end="00:13:43.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s set aside talk of your breakup. Do</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.499" end="00:13:44.999" style="s2">you even know who Bell is?</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.499" end="00:13:45.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buyers trust him. Brands look to him for</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.999" end="00:13:46.799" style="s2">guidance. Now he says you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.899" end="00:13:47.699" style="s2">harassing an exhibitor and disrupting</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.799" end="00:13:48.599" style="s2">his event, and he&#39;s demanding that the</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.699" end="00:13:49.999" style="s2">project handle it formally.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.599" end="00:13:51.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has that much influence? I thought he</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.999" end="00:13:52.899" style="s2">was just a perfumer.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.099" end="00:13:54.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;re upset, but you took Doan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.899" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">phone right in front of Bell. The person</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.299" end="00:13:56.499" style="s2">you need to make things right with now</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.399" end="00:13:57.799" style="s2">is Bell.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.499" end="00:13:59.099" style="s2">Come with me this afternoon, apologize</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.799" end="00:14:00.399" style="s2">sincerely, and put this to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.099" end="00:14:00.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do anything wrong. Why should I</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.399" end="00:14:01.999" style="s2">apologize?</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.999" end="00:14:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a perfumer. He doesn&#39;t get to</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.999" end="00:14:04.199" style="s2">decide who I talk to. Let them</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.099" end="00:14:05.599" style="s2">investigate. They should hear my side,</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.199" end="00:14:06.499" style="s2">too. Don&#39;t make this bigger. If Bell</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.599" end="00:14:07.799" style="s2">pursues it, you&#39;ll lose real</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.499" end="00:14:08.999" style="s2">opportunities. I earned my place by</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.799" end="00:14:10.399" style="s2">closing deals. I won&#39;t beg anyone to</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.999" end="00:14:11.699" style="s2">like me. I&#39;m heading back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.399" end="00:14:12.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay? Adam didn&#39;t look too</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.699" end="00:14:14.699" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.499" end="00:14:15.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Just a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.699" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">If you&#39;re really in trouble, you can</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.801" end="00:14:18.101" style="s2">tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.201" end="00:14:21.201" style="s2">All right. He doesn&#39;t want to talk, so I</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:23.701" style="s2">won&#39;t press it. Come to the hotel with</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.201" end="00:14:25.001" style="s2">me after this. Martin wants to see us.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.701" end="00:14:26.401" style="s2">He didn&#39;t message you? He said he wanted</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.001" end="00:14:28.301" style="s2">to discuss next month&#39;s new product</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.401" end="00:14:30.101" style="s2">showcase arrangements.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.301" end="00:14:32.501" style="s2">Why wasn&#39;t I notified? Something&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.101" end="00:14:34.201" style="s2">right. Martin oversees the hotel&#39;s new</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:35.701" style="s2">product showcase.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.201" end="00:14:38.501" style="s2">He must know why I was the only one who</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.701" end="00:14:38.501" style="s2">wasn&#39;t notified.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.801" end="00:14:43.101" style="s2">Evan?</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.901" end="00:14:43.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian said you wanted to see us. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.101" end="00:14:44.701" style="s2">didn&#39;t get a message.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.801" end="00:14:45.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something I need to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.701" end="00:14:46.501" style="s2">The list for next month&#39;s hotel product</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.701" end="00:14:47.001" style="s2">showcase has changed.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.501" end="00:14:47.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Changed how?</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.001" end="00:14:48.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They considered the product, your work</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.801" end="00:14:49.801" style="s2">with us, and the feedback they received.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.801" end="00:14:50.601" style="s2">Julian stays on. The product showcase</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.801" end="00:14:51.501" style="s2">slot goes to Austin Gray.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.601" end="00:14:52.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Austin could barely get a sentence out</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.501" end="00:14:53.101" style="s2">of the pitch event, and he couldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.201" end="00:14:54.101" style="s2">put together a decent packaging. I have</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.101" end="00:14:54.901" style="s2">sales numbers and connections. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.101" end="00:14:55.601" style="s2">seen both for yourself. Why give mine to</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.901" end="00:14:56.101" style="s2">someone who&#39;s never even run a new</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.601" end="00:14:56.901" style="s2">product showcase?</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.101" end="00:14:57.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Bell and Bear the case room in</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.901" end="00:14:58.701" style="s2">front of everyone this morning. Now I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.801" end="00:14:59.601" style="s2">lost the slot, too, and it went to</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.701" end="00:15:01.101" style="s2">Austin. The guide just confirmed he</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.601" end="00:15:02.201" style="s2">can&#39;t even sell his own product.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.101" end="00:15:03.401" style="s2">Don&#39;t lose heart yet. There may still be</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.201" end="00:15:04.101" style="s2">a way to get the slot back.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.401" end="00:15:05.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.101" end="00:15:06.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those buyers will take calls from Vanch.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.401" end="00:15:07.101" style="s2">I can get them to look at your product</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.101" end="00:15:07.701" style="s2">again. Let me first figure out what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.101" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">really going on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.701" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bell has connections, but Vain has</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.801" end="00:15:12.001" style="s2">money. Maybe one phone call will solve</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.301" end="00:15:13.101" style="s2">everything. Are you sure? I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.001" end="00:15:14.701" style="s2">to cause you trouble over this.</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.101" end="00:15:16.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan, we grew up together. Besides, that</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.701" end="00:15:17.501" style="s2">slot was yours to begin with. They can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.201" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">replace you without good reason. Whoever</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.501" end="00:15:19.901" style="s2">takes the slot, that&#39;s no way to do</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.701" end="00:15:22.601" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.901" end="00:15:22.601" style="s2">Thank you. Really.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.701" end="00:15:26.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether this works out or not, I have to</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.701" end="00:15:29.301" style="s2">hold on tight to my connection with</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.901" end="00:15:29.301" style="s2">Julian.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.701" end="00:15:31.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian?</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.401" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something I need you to look</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.401" end="00:15:34.501" style="s2">into. It&#39;s about Evan Cole. He was</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.101" end="00:15:36.401" style="s2">originally selected for next month&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.501" end="00:15:37.401" style="s2">hotel new product showcase. Now they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.401" end="00:15:39.001" style="s2">suddenly replaced him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.401" end="00:15:41.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contact the people in charge of product</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.001" end="00:15:42.001" style="s2">selection and find out why.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.001" end="00:15:44.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then see how we can correct this</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.001" end="00:15:44.401" style="s2">mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.501" end="00:15:49.301" style="s2">This shouldn&#39;t take long.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.101" end="00:15:53.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked about the new product showcase.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.301" end="00:15:55.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The buyers decide for themselves who to</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.701" end="00:15:56.901" style="s2">select. Asking them to change their</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.401" end="00:15:58.501" style="s2">choice again for us might not be</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.901" end="00:16:00.301" style="s2">appropriate. I didn&#39;t ask you to</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.501" end="00:16:01.801" style="s2">pressure them into changing the list. I</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.301" end="00:16:03.601" style="s2">asked you to find out what happened and</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.801" end="00:16:05.901" style="s2">talk to them. Replacing Evan without</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.601" end="00:16:07.501" style="s2">explaining it is a problem in itself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.901" end="00:16:08.501" style="s2">Let them know Vail is asking about it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.501" end="00:16:10.501" style="s2">These products have already been</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.501" end="00:16:12.501" style="s2">reviewed by several people. There are no</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.501" end="00:16:13.901" style="s2">obvious problems with the process. Also,</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.501" end="00:16:15.401" style="s2">I found something else. They have a</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.901" end="00:16:16.901" style="s2">senior advisor who offered a very</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.401" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">influential opinion.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.901" end="00:16:18.702" style="s2">Lewis Bell.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.901" end="00:16:21.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bell?</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.702" end="00:16:24.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those buyers trust his judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.302" end="00:16:25.502" style="s2">If replacing Evan was his suggestion,</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.002" end="00:16:27.302" style="s2">they&#39;re almost certain not to change</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.502" end="00:16:30.302" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.302" end="00:16:31.702" style="s2">He&#39;s a renowned perfumer. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.302" end="00:16:32.902" style="s2">I&#39;m offering him a chance to work with</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.702" end="00:16:35.102" style="s2">Vail.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.902" end="00:16:36.302" style="s2">What reason does he have to refuse?</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.102" end="00:16:37.502" style="s2">For most people, that really is a very</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.302" end="00:16:39.102" style="s2">attractive opportunity, but Bell is</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.502" end="00:16:40.502" style="s2">different. He spent years building those</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.102" end="00:16:41.602" style="s2">relationships.</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.502" end="00:16:43.202" style="s2">Stores have been selling his perfumes</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.602" end="00:16:44.402" style="s2">for years, and he has the money to fund</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.202" end="00:16:45.302" style="s2">his own development. He doesn&#39;t need our</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.402" end="00:16:48.902" style="s2">support.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.302" end="00:16:48.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What an arrogant bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.902" end="00:16:53.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus, I&#39;ve told Julian we can&#39;t put</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.902" end="00:16:55.102" style="s2">Evan back on the list.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.202" end="00:16:56.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. You handled that well. Should I</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.102" end="00:16:57.802" style="s2">also contact the other buyers and ask</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.702" end="00:17:00.202" style="s2">them not to work with Evan?</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.802" end="00:17:01.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Don&#39;t do anything more. Mr. Vail</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.202" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">only said Julian can&#39;t use our name to</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.902" end="00:17:05.202" style="s2">secure business for Evan. If Evan can</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.602" end="00:17:06.402" style="s2">make a deal on his own, let him do it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.202" end="00:17:07.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian really thinks being the face of</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.402" end="00:17:08.802" style="s2">the brand means he gets to make</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.302" end="00:17:09.902" style="s2">decisions for the boss. The brand</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.802" end="00:17:11.402" style="s2">belongs to Adrian. Without his</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.902" end="00:17:12.802" style="s2">permission, Julian has no right to make</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.402" end="00:17:15.202" style="s2">promises to anyone on someone else&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.802" end="00:17:15.202" style="s2">behalf.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.102" end="00:17:19.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, your video&#39;s being shared</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.502" end="00:17:21.102" style="s2">everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.702" end="00:17:23.702" style="s2">That video I posted this morning has</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.102" end="00:17:25.702" style="s2">passed a million views. Look. Look at</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.702" end="00:17:26.702" style="s2">those hands. I could watch him work all</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.702" end="00:17:28.802" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.702" end="00:17:31.002" style="s2">[laughter] How can he be so focused and</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.802" end="00:17:33.402" style="s2">so attractive at the same time? Please</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.002" end="00:17:35.002" style="s2">tell me this guy is an AI generated.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.402" end="00:17:36.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that face and that skill, he could</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.002" end="00:17:38.702" style="s2">have made a name for himself. Instead,</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.702" end="00:17:40.302" style="s2">he gave his whole life to Evan. I have</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.702" end="00:17:42.802" style="s2">to survive this movie and keep being a</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.302" end="00:17:43.802" style="s2">perfumer. Learn more, practice more. No</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.802" end="00:17:46.402" style="s2">shortcuts.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.802" end="00:17:48.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, I I could have done better.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.402" end="00:17:50.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on. It&#39;s a compliment. Just</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.402" end="00:17:51.802" style="s2">take it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.102" end="00:17:54.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This video of Noah Reed suddenly took</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.802" end="00:17:54.902" style="s2">off this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.002" end="00:17:59.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this video isn&#39;t even a minute</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.502" end="00:18:00.902" style="s2">long, and you&#39;ve already watched it 20</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.302" end="00:18:02.202" style="s2">times.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.902" end="00:18:04.202" style="s2">He&#39;s certainly drawing a lot of</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.202" end="00:18:05.302" style="s2">attention now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.202" end="00:18:07.102" style="s2">To the studio.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.302" end="00:18:08.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.102" end="00:18:09.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been at the blending table all</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.002" end="00:18:10.702" style="s2">afternoon. I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.102" end="00:18:12.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; views and you still need a free meal</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.702" end="00:18:12.802" style="s2">voucher to eat? Some people really</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.102" end="00:18:14.502" style="s2">haven&#39;t changed at all.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.802" end="00:18:15.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan Brooks, Evan&#39;s friend. Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.502" end="00:18:16.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for your own meal first, then you can</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.602" end="00:18:17.202" style="s2">come and find fault with me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.502" end="00:18:18.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.202" end="00:18:20.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this your payment receipt or is it</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.602" end="00:18:20.603" style="s2">the same free meal voucher as mine?</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.402" end="00:18:22.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.603" end="00:18:23.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; with Evan. I&#39;m a business guest.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.203" end="00:18:25.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah worked the entire showcase. He</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.803" end="00:18:25.703" style="s2">doesn&#39;t need your approval to eat a</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.003" end="00:18:28.303" style="s2">sandwich.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.703" end="00:18:30.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep laughing. This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.303" end="00:18:31.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, I can get a bite to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.003" end="00:18:32.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you have to embarrass him like that?</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.103" end="00:18:33.103" style="s2">Ryan sometimes speaks without thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.303" end="00:18:33.603" style="s2">You didn&#39;t have to humiliate him in</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.103" end="00:18:34.603" style="s2">front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:36.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only pointed out that his meal was</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.603" end="00:18:37.103" style="s2">free, too. If that embarrassed him, he</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.103" end="00:18:38.503" style="s2">can pay for his own.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.103" end="00:18:39.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did he start daring to talk to me</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.503" end="00:18:40.003" style="s2">like that? I barely recognize him</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.803" end="00:18:41.103" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.003" end="00:18:42.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; keep this up and don&#39;t expect me to buy</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.103" end="00:18:44.203" style="s2">you anything ever again.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.303" end="00:18:45.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re over, Evan. From now on, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.203" end="00:18:46.703" style="s2">just people who might run into each</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.203" end="00:18:47.403" style="s2">other at work. I don&#39;t expect you to buy</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.703" end="00:18:48.903" style="s2">me anything.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.403" end="00:18:50.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Now you&#39;re pretending you won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.903" end="00:18:53.603" style="s2">spend his money. How much has Evan spent</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.403" end="00:18:55.803" style="s2">on you? At least $20,000, right?</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.603" end="00:18:56.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $20,000? That probably wouldn&#39;t even buy</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.803" end="00:18:57.603" style="s2">the watch he&#39;s wearing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.703" end="00:18:58.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.603" end="00:19:00.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a platinum model with a blue</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.603" end="00:19:01.303" style="s2">enamel tobe. We displayed one exactly</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.103" end="00:19:02.603" style="s2">like it in our store. With that platinum</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.303" end="00:19:04.703" style="s2">case, movement, and diamond set bezel</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.603" end="00:19:05.903" style="s2">alone, this watch retails for $180,000.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.703" end="00:19:07.003" style="s2">So the $20,000 you mentioned comes</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.903" end="00:19:07.403" style="s2">nowhere close to buying the watch on his</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.003" end="00:19:08.503" style="s2">wrist.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.403" end="00:19:09.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a watch with a few tiny</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.503" end="00:19:11.103" style="s2">diamonds. You really expect us to</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.703" end="00:19:11.503" style="s2">believe that price? Noah told you to say</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.103" end="00:19:12.403" style="s2">that, didn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.503" end="00:19:14.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.403" end="00:19:17.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. So if someone says something you</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.003" end="00:19:17.503" style="s2">don&#39;t like, they must be lying. Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.503" end="00:19:22.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was going to pick the plain one.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.603" end="00:19:24.903" style="s2">Adrian handed me this one like it was no</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.903" end="00:19:27.603" style="s2">big deal. Now everyone in the room is</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.903" end="00:19:27.603" style="s2">staring at it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.303" end="00:19:32.703" style="s2">Mr. Vale,</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.203" end="00:19:35.803" style="s2">why is my heart beating so fast? It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.703" end="00:19:35.803" style="s2">just a text message.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.103" end="00:19:41.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a Rolls Race.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.703" end="00:19:42.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the interior&#39;s custom. Look.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.303" end="00:19:45.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.803" end="00:19:45.603" style="s2">Better get in quick.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.403" end="00:19:49.603" style="s2">Sitting next to him is way more</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.703" end="00:19:50.703" style="s2">nerve-racking than texting him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.603" end="00:19:52.203" style="s2">Good evening, Mr. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.703" end="00:19:52.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. Now I don&#39;t even know what to</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.203" end="00:19:54.703" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.703" end="00:19:56.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Is he about to kiss me? Isn&#39;t this</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.703" end="00:19:57.603" style="s2">a little fast?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.603" end="00:20:00.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you planning to leave that bit of</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.603" end="00:20:03.603" style="s2">your coat outside?</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.303" end="00:20:06.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, he did that on purpose. Okay. I know</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.603" end="00:20:08.803" style="s2">what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.003" end="00:20:11.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vale, you missed a spot, too.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.803" end="00:20:11.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I?</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.603" end="00:20:15.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your collar pin, it was crooked earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.103" end="00:20:15.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I should thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.003" end="00:20:16.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now we&#39;re even.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.703" end="00:20:17.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you get this close to everyone whose</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.803" end="00:20:18.703" style="s2">clothes you straighten?</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.903" end="00:20:19.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.703" end="00:20:21.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then keep it that way.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.703" end="00:20:22.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that an order or am I special?</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.603" end="00:20:24.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t expect me to let you get away with</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.903" end="00:20:26.505" style="s2">it easily every time. But you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.305" end="00:20:27.605" style="s2">indulged me twice already.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.505" end="00:20:29.805" style="s2">Have you had dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.605" end="00:20:30.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have. I had a sandwich at the studio.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.805" end="00:20:32.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was it enough?</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.705" end="00:20:33.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m pretty full. Were you going to take</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.105" end="00:20:34.705" style="s2">me to dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.305" end="00:20:36.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I arrived too late.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.705" end="00:20:37.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dessert is different. I can still eat a</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.205" end="00:20:39.505" style="s2">little. Chances like this don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.605" end="00:20:40.305" style="s2">along often. I can make room for a few</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.505" end="00:20:41.405" style="s2">more bites.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.305" end="00:20:42.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really going to keep eating just</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.405" end="00:20:44.405" style="s2">to spend a little more time with me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.905" end="00:20:44.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get to spend more time with you? Of</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.405" end="00:20:46.505" style="s2">course.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.805" end="00:20:47.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; George, back to the hotel. To the</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.505" end="00:20:49.105" style="s2">private dining room.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.505" end="00:20:50.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.105" end="00:20:52.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll serve it with warm vanilla</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.305" end="00:20:53.305" style="s2">crisps. Right now you really could use</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.105" end="00:20:56.605" style="s2">something cold.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.305" end="00:20:56.605" style="s2">Your face is getting redder.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.905" end="00:21:01.905" style="s2">It smells wonderful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.405" end="00:21:07.305" style="s2">Okay, this is way too good. You handled</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.605" end="00:21:08.305" style="s2">the issue with that sample very well.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.305" end="00:21:09.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw the video?</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.305" end="00:21:10.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.705" end="00:21:12.505" style="s2">I like watching you work.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.905" end="00:21:14.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then come watch me work sometime. Just</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.505" end="00:21:15.805" style="s2">the two of us. Whatever scent you want,</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.505" end="00:21:17.805" style="s2">I can blend it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.805" end="00:21:19.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I just ask him to meet me alone? The</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.805" end="00:21:20.905" style="s2">moment I said it, that didn&#39;t sound like</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.205" end="00:21:21.705" style="s2">work at all. Quick, walk it back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.905" end="00:21:23.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought the internet&#39;s new star</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.705" end="00:21:24.605" style="s2">perfumer would be harder to ask out.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.305" end="00:21:26.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t free. The watch you gave me</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.605" end="00:21:27.505" style="s2">could pay a celebrity&#39;s appearance face.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.105" end="00:21:28.905" style="s2">If one watch gets me this much of your</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.505" end="00:21:30.005" style="s2">time, then I really got a bargain. If</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.905" end="00:21:31.405" style="s2">someone else gave you more, would they</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.005" end="00:21:32.705" style="s2">get the same invitation?</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.405" end="00:21:34.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.705" end="00:21:35.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t eat anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.405" end="00:21:37.105" style="s2">But it&#39;d be such a shame to let</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.405" end="00:21:39.105" style="s2">something this delicious melt.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.105" end="00:21:40.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t have to go to waste.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.105" end="00:21:41.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll help me finish it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.805" end="00:21:42.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a problem?</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.705" end="00:21:42.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t mind sharing food with</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.605" end="00:21:44.505" style="s2">someone?</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.805" end="00:21:45.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve watched too many melodramas.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.505" end="00:21:47.205" style="s2">Billionaires on screen always act like</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.905" end="00:21:47.505" style="s2">touching someone else&#39;s fork would kill</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.205" end="00:21:48.705" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.505" end="00:21:52.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They don&#39;t judge what kind of person I</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.705" end="00:21:52.005" style="s2">am by what you see on TV.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:57.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I meant for you to smell it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.505" end="00:21:59.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already bitten it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.305" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">It tastes better.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.505" end="00:22:05.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never said you had to go easy on me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.705" end="00:22:07.805" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if you can stay so calm now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.205" end="00:22:08.905" style="s2">It&#39;s only a little touch.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.805" end="00:22:09.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really can&#39;t behave for even a</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.905" end="00:22:11.205" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.505" end="00:22:12.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. Now he&#39;s holding my hand and he&#39;s</p>
