<p begin="00:22:12.205" end="00:22:14.705" style="s2">happened. Not so brave now? Give me my</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.005" end="00:22:16.305" style="s2">hand back.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.705" end="00:22:18.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time you&#39;re the one who starts it</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.305" end="00:22:19.605" style="s2">and then you try to run.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.005" end="00:22:21.805" style="s2">Are you testing how far I&#39;ll let you go?</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.605" end="00:22:24.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to see how you&#39;ll respond.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.805" end="00:22:25.706" style="s2">So, did you get your answer?</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.205" end="00:22:27.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. He&#39;s better at flirting</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.706" end="00:22:28.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; than I thought.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.106" end="00:22:31.406" style="s2">Having second thoughts? Not in the</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.806" end="00:22:31.406" style="s2">slightest.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.906" end="00:22:36.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vane.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.906" end="00:22:37.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Paul Laurent, the restaurant</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.306" end="00:22:39.706" style="s2">manager. It&#39;s a pleasure to have you</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.706" end="00:22:40.906" style="s2">here for dinner tonight. May I come in</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.706" end="00:22:43.106" style="s2">and say hello?</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.906" end="00:22:46.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People wait to see him even at dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.106" end="00:22:48.106" style="s2">Of course, he&#39;s a billionaire.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.006" end="00:22:49.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s coming. Not so bold now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.106" end="00:22:50.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you looking for an audience to force</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.306" end="00:22:51.706" style="s2">me to admit feelings? I&#39;m not putting on</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.806" end="00:22:53.606" style="s2">a show for them.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.706" end="00:22:55.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You flirted with me first.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.606" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">Now try not to give us away.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.906" end="00:22:59.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in, Paul.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.906" end="00:23:00.806" style="s2">I hope I haven&#39;t interrupted your plans</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.306" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">for this evening. He almost always comes</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.806" end="00:23:04.206" style="s2">here to discuss business. Tonight, he</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.906" end="00:23:05.306" style="s2">actually brought someone just for a</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.206" end="00:23:06.206" style="s2">private dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.306" end="00:23:07.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.206" end="00:23:09.106" style="s2">This batch of tea arrived just this</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.306" end="00:23:10.306" style="s2">morning. I saved a box especially for</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.106" end="00:23:11.306" style="s2">you. I thought you and this gentleman</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.306" end="00:23:12.706" style="s2">might enjoy it after dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.306" end="00:23:14.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pour the tea, wish them good night, and</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.706" end="00:23:15.206" style="s2">leave quickly. He doesn&#39;t like anyone</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.306" end="00:23:16.606" style="s2">hovering nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.206" end="00:23:18.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that sweet fragrance from the tea</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.606" end="00:23:19.806" style="s2">itself or was something else added?</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.106" end="00:23:21.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing else was added. It&#39;s white tea</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.806" end="00:23:23.106" style="s2">with jasmine flowers. The tea garden</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.406" end="00:23:24.906" style="s2">sent us only one small box this season.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.106" end="00:23:27.206" style="s2">It smells sweet, but the tea itself is</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.906" end="00:23:27.206" style="s2">very</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.306" end="00:23:31.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you all right, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.806" end="00:23:35.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The jasmine doesn&#39;t overpower the tea.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.406" end="00:23:36.306" style="s2">Good choice.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.006" end="00:23:37.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is your hand bothering you, sir? Would</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.306" end="00:23:37.906" style="s2">you like a cold towel or a fresh set of</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.606" end="00:23:39.406" style="s2">cutlery?</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.906" end="00:23:41.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. Really, please. Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.406" end="00:23:43.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That look. What did I do wrong just now?</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.706" end="00:23:44.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave the tea, Paul. We won&#39;t need you</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.306" end="00:23:45.506" style="s2">here anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.706" end="00:23:46.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.506" end="00:23:48.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to keep watching him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.906" end="00:23:48.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Enjoy your meal, both of you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.106" end="00:23:51.206" style="s2">If you need anything, I&#39;ll be right</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.906" end="00:23:51.206" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.206" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re finally gone. I can breathe</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.806" end="00:23:55.506" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.206" end="00:23:56.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was only paying you back. Why that</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.506" end="00:23:58.006" style="s2">look as if I done something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.906" end="00:23:58.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say you did anything wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.006" end="00:23:59.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you looking at me like</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.806" end="00:24:00.006" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.106" end="00:24:01.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m looking at you because you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.006" end="00:24:03.506" style="s2">handsome. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.406" end="00:24:05.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.506" end="00:24:07.706" style="s2">Can we leave now?</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.106" end="00:24:08.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.706" end="00:24:10.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.906" end="00:24:12.406" style="s2">Your shirt.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.206" end="00:24:15.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s custom silk, and I had to stain a</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.406" end="00:24:15.406" style="s2">shirt that expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.506" end="00:24:19.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.706" end="00:24:19.106" style="s2">Adrian?</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.906" end="00:24:23.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you leave this on purpose so I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.206" end="00:24:25.306" style="s2">remember you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.506" end="00:24:26.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do it on purpose. I had a firm</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.306" end="00:24:28.206" style="s2">hold of it. You didn&#39;t need to reach out</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.606" end="00:24:29.307" style="s2">and help me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.206" end="00:24:31.107" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.307" end="00:24:32.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.107" end="00:24:33.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me the shirt. I&#39;ll take it to be</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.408" end="00:24:35.207" style="s2">cleaned.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.607" end="00:24:36.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give you the shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.207" end="00:24:38.408" style="s2">Do you want me to take it off right</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.107" end="00:24:38.408" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.707" end="00:24:43.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it off somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.807" end="00:24:44.707" style="s2">Obviously somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.507" end="00:24:47.408" style="s2">Forget it. Let&#39;s stop talking about your</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.707" end="00:24:49.307" style="s2">shirt. Do whatever you want with it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.408" end="00:24:51.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. It&#39;s just lemon sorbet. It&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:51.807" style="s2">wash out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.007" end="00:24:55.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really do get a kick out of winding</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.507" end="00:24:55.807" style="s2">me up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.007" end="00:24:59.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s so focused when he&#39;s working.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.707" end="00:25:00.707" style="s2">Better not disturb him.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.408" end="00:25:00.908" style="s2">What time do you start work tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.707" end="00:25:01.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.908" end="00:25:02.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you still need to go back to the</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.707" end="00:25:04.007" style="s2">studio tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.408" end="00:25:05.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll all ask where I went. Then Evan</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.007" end="00:25:07.307" style="s2">will hear about it. I don&#39;t want to deal</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.207" end="00:25:09.607" style="s2">with any of that tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.307" end="00:25:11.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Home, George.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.607" end="00:25:13.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making the decision for me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.307" end="00:25:14.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you&#39;d like the invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.207" end="00:25:15.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I don&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.507" end="00:25:17.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then George can take you back.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.607" end="00:25:19.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s home, and he invited me himself.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.707" end="00:25:21.908" style="s2">He&#39;s really giving me a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.307" end="00:25:23.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never said I wasn&#39;t going.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.908" end="00:25:26.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow. What a beautiful view.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.908" end="00:25:27.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually brought someone home. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.007" end="00:25:28.908" style="s2">a first.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.107" end="00:25:30.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you need anything, just let me know.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.908" end="00:25:32.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve stayed in plenty of nice hotels,</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.807" end="00:25:34.107" style="s2">but compared to this place, they might</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.307" end="00:25:35.607" style="s2">as well be roadside motels.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.107" end="00:25:36.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guest rooms are down that hall. Stay</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.607" end="00:25:37.607" style="s2">in whichever one you like.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.408" end="00:25:38.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any of them? Julian doesn&#39;t have a room</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.607" end="00:25:39.707" style="s2">here, does he? I don&#39;t want to wander in</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.707" end="00:25:40.007" style="s2">and find his things. He&#39;s hardly ever</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.707" end="00:25:41.307" style="s2">been here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.007" end="00:25:41.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. So Julian can&#39;t just come and go</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.307" end="00:25:43.107" style="s2">here either.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.908" end="00:25:45.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes things much easier. He</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.107" end="00:25:45.908" style="s2">already hates me enough.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.007" end="00:25:51.207" style="s2">This place is just right.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.607" end="00:25:52.607" style="s2">I need to sort these out. Knowing how to</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.207" end="00:25:55.807" style="s2">blend perfume doesn&#39;t mean I can</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.607" end="00:25:57.707" style="s2">understand every note he wrote.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.807" end="00:26:01.007" style="s2">One bottle at a time. Check the numbers</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.707" end="00:26:01.007" style="s2">first, then the notes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.908" end="00:26:07.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you coming back tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.408" end="00:26:08.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.307" end="00:26:10.707" style="s2">I&#39;ll come by tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.807" end="00:26:12.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you breathing so hard?</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.707" end="00:26:13.908" style="s2">Were you just running or did something</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.607" end="00:26:17.408" style="s2">happen?</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.908" end="00:26:18.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when is that any of your business?</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.408" end="00:26:21.807" style="s2">He actually hung up on me. Now he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.908" end="00:26:21.807" style="s2">blocked this number too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.207" end="00:26:24.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe he&#39;s busy or maybe the signal</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.307" end="00:26:27.607" style="s2">dropped.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.807" end="00:26:29.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s doing it on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.607" end="00:26:30.507" style="s2">Forget it. It&#39;s not your fault. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.507" end="00:26:32.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan?</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.507" end="00:26:35.009" style="s2">So this is where you are.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.609" end="00:26:36.709" style="s2">She&#39;s Noah&#39;s co-worker, right?</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.009" end="00:26:38.209" style="s2">Is this about the launch? I had my</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.709" end="00:26:39.509" style="s2">assistant check again. So, the decision</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.209" end="00:26:41.309" style="s2">is final. They won&#39;t change it. Who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.509" end="00:26:42.709" style="s2">this? What happened just now?</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.309" end="00:26:44.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe Morgan. I work with Noah. We just</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.709" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">wanted to ask how he was doing. He left</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.109" end="00:26:46.409" style="s2">after he and Evan fell out and nobody</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.509" end="00:26:47.909" style="s2">knows where he went.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.409" end="00:26:49.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hung up on me. Then he blocked her</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.909" end="00:26:50.809" style="s2">number too. He&#39;s made all this trouble</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.409" end="00:26:52.409" style="s2">just to get Evan to chase after him.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.809" end="00:26:54.109" style="s2">He&#39;s done this before. He&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.409" end="00:26:55.009" style="s2">Did he say where he was or who he was</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.109" end="00:26:56.209" style="s2">with?</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.009" end="00:26:56.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably the same person who picked him</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.209" end="00:26:57.609" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.509" end="00:26:59.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone sent me a photo of him getting</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.609" end="00:27:00.409" style="s2">out of a custom luxury car. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.209" end="00:27:01.109" style="s2">see cars like that often. I don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.409" end="00:27:02.409" style="s2">whose car it is.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.109" end="00:27:03.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.409" end="00:27:05.109" style="s2">Can&#39;t see the license plate. Can&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.809" end="00:27:07.809" style="s2">out who&#39;s inside either.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.109" end="00:27:08.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He cares more than he admits.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.809" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">I have something else to do. I need to</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.909" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.409" end="00:27:14.609" style="s2">Everyone knows what you&#39;re capable of.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.609" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep an eye out for you at that</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.609" end="00:27:17.709" style="s2">buyer meeting we talked about.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.409" end="00:27:22.509" style="s2">I haven&#39;t slept this comfortably in a</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.909" end="00:27:22.509" style="s2">long time.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.309" end="00:27:27.109" style="s2">All right. First the shower.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.909" end="00:27:28.409" style="s2">It looks nice, but I&#39;m not wearing</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.109" end="00:27:30.109" style="s2">something this tight first thing in the</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.409" end="00:27:31.309" style="s2">morning. I&#39;ll wear this instead. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.109" end="00:27:33.009" style="s2">start working till 10:00. I can practice</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.309" end="00:27:34.309" style="s2">a little before breakfast. The scents in</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.009" end="00:27:37.309" style="s2">here have already mixed together. I need</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.309" end="00:27:37.309" style="s2">somewhere with fresh air.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.709" end="00:27:46.209" style="s2">This feels much better.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.109" end="00:27:46.209" style="s2">There&#39;s plenty of room out here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.309" end="00:27:51.209" style="s2">I&#39;ll practice here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.909" end="00:27:52.809" style="s2">Let the last scent fade first.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.209" end="00:27:56.309" style="s2">Too strong.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.809" end="00:27:58.609" style="s2">Use a little less of this one, slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.309" end="00:28:00.309" style="s2">Now let&#39;s compare.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.609" end="00:28:01.909" style="s2">That&#39;s much softer.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.309" end="00:28:04.209" style="s2">Leave the formula below as it is for</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.909" end="00:28:04.209" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.809" end="00:28:08.509" style="s2">Let&#39;s check once more.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.709" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">That&#39;s it. I can only smell Noah&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.509" end="00:28:12.309" style="s2">pheromones. Now even my own pheromones</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.709" end="00:28:13.809" style="s2">are changing.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.309" end="00:28:15.509" style="s2">How long has he been sitting there? I</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.809" end="00:28:18.109" style="s2">was so absorbed I didn&#39;t notice him the</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.509" end="00:28:19.109" style="s2">whole time. I like you like this. How</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.109" end="00:28:21.909" style="s2">long have you been watching?</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.109" end="00:28:23.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About 10 minutes. You were very focused.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.909" end="00:28:24.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought your time was valuable.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.409" end="00:28:26.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.909" end="00:28:27.909" style="s2">That &#39;s why I don&#39;t like wasting it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.109" end="00:28:29.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is watching me practice the basics over</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.909" end="00:28:31.009" style="s2">and over worth it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.209" end="00:28:31.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m seeing how my investment is doing.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.009" end="00:28:33.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the verdict?</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.909" end="00:28:35.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still considering.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.109" end="00:28:36.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then look closely. I don&#39;t like being</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.210" end="00:28:39.110" style="s2">underestimated. You could announce</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.810" end="00:28:40.910" style="s2">yourself next time. It&#39;s just practice.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.110" end="00:28:42.910" style="s2">Nothing worth watching.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.910" end="00:28:44.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t find it boring.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.910" end="00:28:45.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll take that as a compliment.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.510" end="00:28:47.210" style="s2">Just finished working out?</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.510" end="00:28:48.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I came out for some air and then I</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.210" end="00:28:49.910" style="s2">caught the scent of Lily of the Vose.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.710" end="00:28:50.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one of these has Lily of the Vose in</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.910" end="00:28:51.910" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.910" end="00:28:53.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t talking about what&#39;s in the</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.910" end="00:28:54.610" style="s2">bottles.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.510" end="00:28:57.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you wanted to see me, you could have</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.610" end="00:28:57.210" style="s2">just said so.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.310" end="00:29:01.510" style="s2">Let&#39;s go inside. It&#39;s getting a little</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.710" end="00:29:02.710" style="s2">chilly out here.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.510" end="00:29:05.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.710" end="00:29:05.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.410" end="00:29:08.910" style="s2">This is really good. Your chef really</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.210" end="00:29:10.910" style="s2">knows what he&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.910" end="00:29:12.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of car do you like?</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.910" end="00:29:13.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An SUV would suit you. Comfortable with</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.510" end="00:29:15.110" style="s2">room for your samples. Are you giving me</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.910" end="00:29:15.710" style="s2">a car? It would make getting around</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.110" end="00:29:17.010" style="s2">easy.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.710" end="00:29:18.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I want it, but if I take the</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:19.910" style="s2">car, people will ask who gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.610" end="00:29:20.810" style="s2">Would he let me say his name? You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.910" end="00:29:21.810" style="s2">have to give me that.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.810" end="00:29:23.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.810" end="00:29:25.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was planning to save $20,000 for a</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.410" end="00:29:26.410" style="s2">smaller used electric car. Easy to drive</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.410" end="00:29:27.410" style="s2">and easy to park.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.410" end="00:29:29.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now?</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.410" end="00:29:30.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you&#39;ve already given me enough.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.310" end="00:29:30.910" style="s2">I don&#39;t like feeling as though I owe</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.510" end="00:29:32.510" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.910" end="00:29:33.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want a car? You just want to know</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.510" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">what I&#39;ll expect in return.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.910" end="00:29:36.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When people give you things, they</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.910" end="00:29:37.210" style="s2">usually want something in return.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.310" end="00:29:38.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not asking you for anything in</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.210" end="00:29:40.510" style="s2">return right now. If you feel bad about</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.910" end="00:29:42.310" style="s2">it, let me watch you work again next</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.510" end="00:29:44.210" style="s2">time. A black Bentley SUV for carrying</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.310" end="00:29:45.710" style="s2">your samples. I&#39;ll arrange a driver.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.210" end="00:29:47.610" style="s2">Pick another car for yourself. Get two</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.710" end="00:29:48.310" style="s2">cars. One for work, one you actually</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.610" end="00:29:50.110" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.310" end="00:29:51.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he like this with everyone else or am</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.110" end="00:29:53.110" style="s2">I really different?</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.010" end="00:29:54.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then something smaller in light green.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.110" end="00:29:55.710" style="s2">Just don&#39;t make it so expensive it needs</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.210" end="00:29:56.710" style="s2">its own bodyguard.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.710" end="00:30:00.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Owen,</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.710" end="00:30:01.110" style="s2">bring the car customization catalog.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.310" end="00:30:02.310" style="s2">Pick one from here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.110" end="00:30:03.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I drive one of these cars, people</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.310" end="00:30:04.110" style="s2">will think some rich old man is keeping</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.810" end="00:30:05.810" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.110" end="00:30:07.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could let me pick for you. There&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.810" end="00:30:09.510" style="s2">gold convertible downstairs with a</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.510" end="00:30:11.510" style="s2">mirror finish body, white leather, and</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.510" end="00:30:12.910" style="s2">my initials embroidered on the seats.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.510" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Made up your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.910" end="00:30:15.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you end up with a car like that?</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.310" end="00:30:16.210" style="s2">Did you secretly dream of being a rock</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.710" end="00:30:17.810" style="s2">star?</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.210" end="00:30:19.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A client had it custom made for me. I</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.810" end="00:30:19.610" style="s2">thought it was interesting, so I kept</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.010" end="00:30:20.710" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.610" end="00:30:21.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.710" end="00:30:23.210" style="s2">I like white.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.710" end="00:30:25.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Bentley can be delivered this</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.210" end="00:30:26.610" style="s2">afternoon. The Ferrari will take a</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.210" end="00:30:28.110" style="s2">little longer.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.610" end="00:30:29.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We ordered you to choose the option.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.110" end="00:30:31.310" style="s2">It&#39;s as casual as ordering two cups of</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.810" end="00:30:33.910" style="s2">coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.310" end="00:30:35.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice shirt. Didn&#39;t Evan always complain</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.910" end="00:30:36.310" style="s2">that you dressed to draw too much</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.010" end="00:30:37.112" style="s2">attention?</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.310" end="00:30:38.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He did.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.112" end="00:30:39.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We broke up. He doesn&#39;t get to have an</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.712" end="00:30:40.912" style="s2">opinion anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.712" end="00:30:42.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, did you block my number?</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.912" end="00:30:42.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last night really wasn&#39;t my fault. Evan</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.012" end="00:30:43.212" style="s2">wanted to call you, so we just took my</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.912" end="00:30:43.812" style="s2">phone.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.212" end="00:30:44.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what exactly are you doing then</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.812" end="00:30:45.712" style="s2">you&#39;re breathing so hard?</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.612" end="00:30:46.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorting samples, just the things I use</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.712" end="00:30:47.012" style="s2">for work every day.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.212" end="00:30:48.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wonder Evan always says you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.012" end="00:30:48.712" style="s2">difficult. And by the way, Julian came</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.112" end="00:30:51.812" style="s2">to see him last night.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.712" end="00:30:51.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I am difficult.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.012" end="00:30:55.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just wait.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.212" end="00:30:57.212" style="s2">When Evan finally stops paying him any</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.912" end="00:31:00.412" style="s2">attention, let&#39;s see if he doesn&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.212" end="00:31:01.712" style="s2">crying and beg Evan to take him back.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.412" end="00:31:03.812" style="s2">I think he means it this time.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.712" end="00:31:05.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too. I saw that video of him working</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.812" end="00:31:07.512" style="s2">yesterday. Someone said his ex showed up</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.912" end="00:31:08.012" style="s2">and Lewis Bell gave him a real dressing</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.512" end="00:31:09.512" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.012" end="00:31:10.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? What did they say?</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.512" end="00:31:11.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve already broken up. You&#39;re way</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.612" end="00:31:12.712" style="s2">behind. That guy took his phone and</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.612" end="00:31:13.212" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t leave him alone. Lewis told him</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.712" end="00:31:14.212" style="s2">to shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.212" end="00:31:15.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, what does this mean?</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.212" end="00:31:17.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday someone said Noah spent</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.312" end="00:31:19.612" style="s2">$20,000 of Evan&#39;s money. Then a jeweler</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.012" end="00:31:21.912" style="s2">says watch $180,000.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.612" end="00:31:23.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $180,000?</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.912" end="00:31:25.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That can&#39;t be right.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.612" end="00:31:28.112" style="s2">That&#39;s the one he wore yesterday. That</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.712" end="00:31:30.112" style="s2">watch costs $180,000?</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.112" end="00:31:31.812" style="s2">So those are real diamonds?</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.112" end="00:31:32.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I mean, even if it&#39;s true, I</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.812" end="00:31:33.512" style="s2">thought it&#39;d be a few thousand dollars</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.912" end="00:31:34.612" style="s2">at most.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.512" end="00:31:35.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Evan buy it?</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.612" end="00:31:37.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. His own car isn&#39;t even worth</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.912" end="00:31:39.012" style="s2">$90,000. Do you think he&#39;d buy Noah a</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.712" end="00:31:40.412" style="s2">watch worth more than twice as much as</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.012" end="00:31:42.112" style="s2">his own car?</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.412" end="00:31:44.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that why he doesn&#39;t care what happens</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.112" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">between Evan and Julian. He&#39;s already</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.212" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">found someone richer.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.412" end="00:31:50.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.312" end="00:31:54.312" style="s2">Here to cause trouble again?</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.412" end="00:31:57.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So many people praise you online.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.012" end="00:31:58.912" style="s2">Feeling smuck? For Evan&#39;s sake, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.712" end="00:32:00.412" style="s2">giving you one chance to make this</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.912" end="00:32:01.612" style="s2">right. Sign this apology statement.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.412" end="00:32:01.912" style="s2">Admit you falsely accused me and it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.612" end="00:32:03.612" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.912" end="00:32:04.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You crossed my name off my work. Now you</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.612" end="00:32:05.812" style="s2">want me to admit I made it up?</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.612" end="00:32:06.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Write down what you did and apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.812" end="00:32:07.912" style="s2">me. Then we can talk.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.912" end="00:32:09.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you kidding? You&#39;re just a</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.912" end="00:32:11.012" style="s2">small-time perfumer. You&#39;re in no</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.312" end="00:32:12.012" style="s2">position to demand an apology from me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.012" end="00:32:13.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then be a good dog and get out of my</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.012" end="00:32:14.612" style="s2">way. You stole someone else&#39;s hard work.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.612" end="00:32:15.712" style="s2">You call that professional skill?</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.612" end="00:32:16.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time you open your mouth, someone</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.712" end="00:32:17.912" style="s2">else does the work and you take the</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.512" end="00:32:19.012" style="s2">credit. Want me to read it aloud? Let</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.912" end="00:32:19.612" style="s2">everyone hear why you&#39;re so desperate</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.012" end="00:32:20.912" style="s2">for my signature.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.612" end="00:32:22.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that statement gets out, everyone</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.912" end="00:32:22.812" style="s2">will know I was pressuring him to change</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.112" end="00:32:24.612" style="s2">his story.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.812" end="00:32:26.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.612" end="00:32:27.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Movie Noah kept backing down. They took</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.212" end="00:32:29.112" style="s2">everything from him and he still ended</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.612" end="00:32:30.412" style="s2">up dead. Blake was part of it too. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.112" end="00:32:31.912" style="s2">not putting up with him. Grant still</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.412" end="00:32:33.412" style="s2">owes me my pay. Blake could use him to</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.912" end="00:32:34.912" style="s2">get to me. That old boss was bad enough.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.412" end="00:32:36.112" style="s2">Blake&#39;s even worse. Still, Adrian didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.912" end="00:32:39.212" style="s2">sound worried at all. Hearing that from</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.112" end="00:32:39.212" style="s2">him makes me feel a lot better.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.812" end="00:32:41.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan,</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.313" end="00:32:44.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; he humiliated me at the launch. I gave</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.913" end="00:32:45.413" style="s2">him a chance to apologize. He refused.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.313" end="00:32:46.913" style="s2">Then he threatened me with a phone</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.413" end="00:32:47.413" style="s2">camera saying he&#39;d humiliate me in front</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.913" end="00:32:49.213" style="s2">of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.413" end="00:32:50.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blake handles trouble for Julian. Plenty</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.213" end="00:32:51.913" style="s2">of people have been on the receiving end</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.713" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">of his tactics.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.913" end="00:32:53.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah&#39;s getting more and more out of</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.013" end="00:32:55.513" style="s2">line.</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.513" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Since you two have broken up,</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.513" end="00:32:58.113" style="s2">I&#39;m going to teach him a lesson this</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.713" end="00:32:58.413" style="s2">time. You&#39;re not having second thoughts,</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.113" end="00:33:00.113" style="s2">are you?</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.413" end="00:33:01.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He found himself a rich man and thinks</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.113" end="00:33:03.213" style="s2">no one can touch him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.613" end="00:33:04.913" style="s2">But that man won&#39;t fall out with Blake&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.213" end="00:33:06.913" style="s2">company over a relationship that&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:08.813" style="s2">a fling. Once Blake has blocked every</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.913" end="00:33:10.513" style="s2">path he has, he won&#39;t have anyone left</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.813" end="00:33:11.813" style="s2">to turn to.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.513" end="00:33:13.213" style="s2">Then he&#39;ll find out what reality is</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.813" end="00:33:14.513" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.213" end="00:33:16.113" style="s2">He&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.513" end="00:33:17.613" style="s2">He&#39;ll beg me to clean up his mess.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.113" end="00:33:19.513" style="s2">Sooner or later,</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.613" end="00:33:21.513" style="s2">he&#39;ll remember who was truly willing to</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.513" end="00:33:23.813" style="s2">help him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.513" end="00:33:25.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back off. Don&#39;t touch my things. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.813" end="00:33:29.213" style="s2">finished, Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.513" end="00:33:30.213" style="s2">No one will ever work with you again.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.213" end="00:33:31.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.213" end="00:33:33.013" style="s2">Stay away from him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.813" end="00:33:34.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan,</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.013" end="00:33:35.713" style="s2">you&#39;re finally here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.613" end="00:33:36.713" style="s2">Please</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.713" end="00:33:39.913" style="s2">help me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.713" end="00:33:39.913" style="s2">They just won&#39;t leave me alone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.313" end="00:33:43.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He threatened me in front of all those</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.513" end="00:33:45.413" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.513" end="00:33:47.513" style="s2">If he won&#39;t apologize, then let him face</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.413" end="00:33:49.013" style="s2">the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.513" end="00:33:49.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.013" end="00:33:53.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.913" end="00:33:53.113" style="s2">That&#39;s all I needed to hear from you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.113" end="00:34:00.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Things are going exactly the way I</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.613" end="00:34:01.713" style="s2">wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.513" end="00:34:02.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found the background information you</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.713" end="00:34:05.513" style="s2">asked for.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.913" end="00:34:07.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant Foster, his former boss, he</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.513" end="00:34:08.613" style="s2">withheld his pay, made him cover the</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.013" end="00:34:10.713" style="s2">cost of materials, and kept asking him</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.613" end="00:34:13.713" style="s2">for help.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.713" end="00:34:16.513" style="s2">How pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.713" end="00:34:18.713" style="s2">He can&#39;t even get his own wages back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.513" end="00:34:19.613" style="s2">Yet he dares to act tough in front of</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.713" end="00:34:20.813" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.613" end="00:34:21.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has no real backing. With that pretty</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.813" end="00:34:23.113" style="s2">face, he could find a date, but no one</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.913" end="00:34:24.113" style="s2">who truly stand behind him. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.113" end="00:34:25.313" style="s2">directly take away his spot at the</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.113" end="00:34:26.513" style="s2">shared studio. But Grant&#39;s business</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.313" end="00:34:27.413" style="s2">depends on a few regular clients.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.513" end="00:34:28.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victor Stone, the one who&#39;s been chasing</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.413" end="00:34:29.113" style="s2">our company for months trying to get a</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.413" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">launch order?</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.113" end="00:34:32.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.513" end="00:34:33.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blake, it&#39;s so good to hear from you. Is</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.213" end="00:34:33.713" style="s2">there anything your company needs me to</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.413" end="00:34:35.913" style="s2">do?</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.713" end="00:34:37.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I call just to see how you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.913" end="00:34:37.713" style="s2">Though there is a small favor I&#39;d like</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.213" end="00:34:39.013" style="s2">to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.713" end="00:34:39.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me. If I can do it, I&#39;ll do it</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.013" end="00:34:40.713" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.513" end="00:34:41.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant Foster supplies you, right? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.713" end="00:34:42.314" style="s2">caused me a little trouble. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.614" end="00:34:42.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; want to see you giving him more</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.314" end="00:34:43.814" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.714" end="00:34:44.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, that&#39;s easy. I&#39;ll cancel his</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.814" end="00:34:45.914" style="s2">orders and I&#39;ll let the other buyers</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.814" end="00:34:46.914" style="s2">know to stay away from his goods.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.914" end="00:34:47.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then thank you. When the company next</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.914" end="00:34:48.514" style="s2">discusses suppliers, I&#39;ll be sure to</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.914" end="00:34:51.114" style="s2">mention you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.514" end="00:34:53.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anytime, Blake. Anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.114" end="00:34:55.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One phone call.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.614" end="00:34:57.214" style="s2">That&#39;s all it took.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.414" end="00:35:00.414" style="s2">It&#39;s been two hours. How hard can it be</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.214" end="00:35:00.414" style="s2">to cancel a few orders?</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.314" end="00:35:04.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Daniel Ross, Mr. Stone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.814" end="00:35:05.414" style="s2">assistant. What can I do for you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.214" end="00:35:06.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you answering?</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.414" end="00:35:07.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Stone is in emergency need. I can</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.714" end="00:35:08.514" style="s2">pass it along.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.414" end="00:35:09.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spoke to him two hours ago. The Grant</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.514" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">Foster orders tell me they&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.414" end="00:35:11.614" style="s2">canceled.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.914" end="00:35:12.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve checked, Mr. Wait. You didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.614" end="00:35:14.014" style="s2">cancel them?</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.514" end="00:35:15.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract is still valid. We have no</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.014" end="00:35:15.514" style="s2">business reason to terminate the</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.014" end="00:35:16.614" style="s2">partnership.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.514" end="00:35:17.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what you checked. Victor</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.614" end="00:35:18.814" style="s2">personally promised me he&#39;d pull those</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.814" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">orders. Who the hell are you to go back</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.814" end="00:35:20.614" style="s2">on his word?</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.314" end="00:35:21.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please watch your tone, Mr. Mercer. We</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.614" end="00:35:22.614" style="s2">did. He&#39;s decided he won&#39;t fabricate a</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.714" end="00:35:23.414" style="s2">reason to tear up contracts that are</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.614" end="00:35:24.214" style="s2">being properly fulfilled.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.414" end="00:35:25.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re willing to offend even us for</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.214" end="00:35:25.614" style="s2">Grant? You still want our company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.214" end="00:35:26.914" style="s2">business?</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.614" end="00:35:28.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We run our own company, not a department</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.914" end="00:35:29.214" style="s2">of yours. Mr. Stone asked me to be</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.114" end="00:35:30.314" style="s2">clear. If your company wants to dictate</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.214" end="00:35:31.514" style="s2">every decision we make, you&#39;re welcome</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.314" end="00:35:32.614" style="s2">to buy us first. Otherwise, our choice</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.514" end="00:35:33.814" style="s2">of suppliers is none of your concern.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.614" end="00:35:37.514" style="s2">Have a pleasant afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.814" end="00:35:37.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello? How dare you hang up on me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.514" end="00:35:48.314" style="s2">Two hours ago, Victor couldn&#39;t wait to</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.014" end="00:35:50.514" style="s2">do me a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.314" end="00:35:52.614" style="s2">Now he won&#39;t even take my calls.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.514" end="00:35:53.714" style="s2">Who the hell is Grant?</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.614" end="00:35:55.614" style="s2">Why would he rather lose our business</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.714" end="00:35:56.914" style="s2">just to protect him?</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.614" end="00:35:58.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull up Grant Foster&#39;s partnership</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.914" end="00:36:00.114" style="s2">records. Cancel all the remaining</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.414" end="00:36:01.914" style="s2">orders. Tell the other buyers he can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.114" end="00:36:03.414" style="s2">be relied on to deliver. I don&#39;t want us</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.914" end="00:36:04.914" style="s2">pulling our orders only for someone else</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.414" end="00:36:06.114" style="s2">to turn around and give him business.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.914" end="00:36:07.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And don&#39;t give him any favors because of</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.114" end="00:36:09.214" style="s2">this call. No additional orders, no</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.614" end="00:36:10.114" style="s2">higher prices, no special treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.214" end="00:36:11.714" style="s2">Everything stays as it was.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.114" end="00:36:12.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orders unchanged, terms unchanged. We</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.714" end="00:36:14.014" style="s2">won&#39;t touch a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.614" end="00:36:14.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Thank you for your cooperation,</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.014" end="00:36:15.914" style="s2">Mr. Stone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.914" end="00:36:17.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.914" end="00:36:18.814" style="s2">are we still canceling Grant&#39;s orders?</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.114" end="00:36:20.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Handle his business as usual. No</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.814" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">delays and no funny business.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.314" end="00:36:22.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blake isn&#39;t even the boss of that PR</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.514" end="00:36:23.914" style="s2">firm. His boss would never go</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.714" end="00:36:25.314" style="s2">head-to-head with Adrian Vale just to</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.914" end="00:36:27.914" style="s2">save him a little face.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.314" end="00:36:27.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, come in.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.214" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">If Blake calls again, push back. The</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.214" end="00:36:32.614" style="s2">contract remains valid. That&#39;s all you</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.514" end="00:36:34.814" style="s2">tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.614" end="00:36:36.214" style="s2">Don&#39;t mention Mr. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.814" end="00:36:38.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stone will keep the original orders.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.214" end="00:36:39.414" style="s2">Grant won&#39;t know we intervened.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.314" end="00:36:40.414" style="s2">Noah hasn&#39;t asked about it or mentioned</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.414" end="00:36:41.814" style="s2">Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.414" end="00:36:43.416" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell him yet.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.814" end="00:36:46.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before, this reaction would stop as as</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.416" end="00:36:46.716" style="s2">he left, now it doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.916" end="00:36:51.816" style="s2">That was fast.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.916" end="00:36:53.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.816" end="00:36:54.716" style="s2">am I interrupting your work?</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.416" end="00:36:55.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finished. I was just about to go to</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.716" end="00:36:56.416" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.016" end="00:36:57.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got good news. Stone&#39;s purchasing</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.416" end="00:36:58.616" style="s2">manager called me personally this</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.416" end="00:36:59.616" style="s2">afternoon. He asked about the studio</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.616" end="00:37:00.516" style="s2">about handle before and about everyone</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.616" end="00:37:02.116" style="s2">who&#39;d ever worked for me. He asked in</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.516" end="00:37:03.316" style="s2">great detail. He&#39;s clearly planning to</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.116" end="00:37:04.416" style="s2">give me bigger business. After all these</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.316" end="00:37:05.316" style="s2">years of struggle, I&#39;m finally going to</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.416" end="00:37:08.916" style="s2">get ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.316" end="00:37:12.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.916" end="00:37:14.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now it&#39;s time to bring up the money.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.920" end="00:37:14.940" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.116" end="00:37:20.016" style="s2">Before the big order comes in, I need</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.416" end="00:37:22.216" style="s2">some money to tide me over. Materials,</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.016" end="00:37:23.316" style="s2">bovins and entertaining clients. Help me</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.216" end="00:37:24.316" style="s2">out for now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.316" end="00:37:25.216" style="s2">Once the money comes in, I&#39;ll pay you</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.316" end="00:37:27.016" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.216" end="00:37:28.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.016" end="00:37:31.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $50,000.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.916" end="00:37:33.416" style="s2">That&#39;ll be enough for now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.116" end="00:37:35.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have $50,000.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.416" end="00:37:36.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t, but your boyfriend does.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.416" end="00:37:38.916" style="s2">Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.816" end="00:37:40.416" style="s2">everyone saw your watch</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.916" end="00:37:42.816" style="s2">and the cars that pick you up and drop</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.416" end="00:37:44.116" style="s2">you off.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.816" end="00:37:45.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the borrowed car and the fake</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.116" end="00:37:48.216" style="s2">watch?</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.416" end="00:37:49.216" style="s2">I could get you a fake watch though,</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.216" end="00:37:50.316" style="s2">but it doesn&#39;t look like it&#39;ll pay your</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.216" end="00:37:52.216" style="s2">bills.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.316" end="00:37:54.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t pretend with me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.216" end="00:37:56.516" style="s2">What looks like yours, you can&#39;t find</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.316" end="00:38:00.116" style="s2">someone wealthy?</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.516" end="00:38:01.516" style="s2">$50,000 is nothing to people like that.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.116" end="00:38:04.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.516" end="00:38:06.116" style="s2">You just said you were borrowing money.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.116" end="00:38:07.716" style="s2">Am I lending it to you</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.116" end="00:38:09.316" style="s2">or giving it to you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.716" end="00:38:11.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course it&#39;s a loan.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.316" end="00:38:12.316" style="s2">Once the new orders come in,</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.416" end="00:38:14.916" style="s2">I&#39;ll have the money.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.316" end="00:38:18.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then send me the repayment date.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.916" end="00:38:20.416" style="s2">Put it in writing and include interest.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.316" end="00:38:22.116" style="s2">If you&#39;re borrowing money for business,</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.416" end="00:38:23.616" style="s2">we follow business rules.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.116" end="00:38:25.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interest?</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.616" end="00:38:27.116" style="s2">After all I&#39;ve done for you, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.416" end="00:38:29.216" style="s2">charging me interest? I gave you your</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.116" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">start in this business and now you want</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.216" end="00:38:32.016" style="s2">to make money off me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.916" end="00:38:33.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.016" end="00:38:35.616" style="s2">you never intended to pay me back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t twist my words.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.616" end="00:38:39.916" style="s2">Who gave you a workbench?</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:43.016" style="s2">Who brought you your first clients?</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.916" end="00:38:44.116" style="s2">I&#39;ve spent at least $10,000 on you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.016" end="00:38:45.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I paid for my own training, the</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.116" end="00:38:47.017" style="s2">materials too. That $10,000 was the pay</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.816" end="00:38:48.117" style="s2">I was owed after finishing the work.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.017" end="00:38:50.017" style="s2">Client the rest bought my formula and</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.117" end="00:38:50.917" style="s2">paid you $80,000. You took every penny.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.017" end="00:38:52.017" style="s2">You said the rest went to expenses.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.917" end="00:38:53.817" style="s2">Later. Fine. We&#39;ll call that 10,000 like</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.017" end="00:38:57.417" style="s2">you said. What about the other 70,000?</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.817" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU UNGRATEFUL BASTARD!</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.417" end="00:39:01.717" style="s2">THE CLIENTS are mine. I signed the</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.317" end="00:39:03.417" style="s2">contract. That money belonged to the</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.717" end="00:39:04.817" style="s2">company in the first place.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.417" end="00:39:05.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your company? I spent night after night</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.817" end="00:39:07.117" style="s2">reworking those batches for you and you</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.917" end="00:39:08.017" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t even answer the phone. Whenever</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:09.117" style="s2">there was real work to do you</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.017" end="00:39:10.517" style="s2">disappeared. The moment money showed up</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.117" end="00:39:11.817" style="s2">suddenly all the credit was yours. Even</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.517" end="00:39:12.517" style="s2">the biggest order won&#39;t do you any good.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.817" end="00:39:13.517" style="s2">You&#39;re still the man who waits for</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.517" end="00:39:16.317" style="s2">someone else to do the work for him.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.517" end="00:39:18.217" style="s2">Don&#39;t expect another dollar from me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.317" end="00:39:21.117" style="s2">Pay me what you owe me and stop calling</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.217" end="00:39:21.117" style="s2">me to ask for money.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.717" end="00:39:29.117" style="s2">That should keep him quiet for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.917" end="00:39:35.317" style="s2">I didn&#39;t even notice I&#39;d walked this</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.217" end="00:39:37.017" style="s2">far.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.317" end="00:39:39.017" style="s2">Oh no. How long has he been waiting</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.017" end="00:39:40.617" style="s2">there? That argument just now. He must</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.017" end="00:39:41.817" style="s2">have heard every word.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.617" end="00:39:43.817" style="s2">Well there goes the good impression I</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.817" end="00:39:45.017" style="s2">worked so hard to make. Fine. He heard</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:46.017" style="s2">it. I can&#39;t take back what I said.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.017" end="00:39:46.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t leave him much room to argue</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.017" end="00:39:47.217" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.217" end="00:39:48.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he have to bring it up right away?</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.217" end="00:39:49.017" style="s2">He started it and I didn&#39;t make any of</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.617" end="00:39:49.517" style="s2">it up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.017" end="00:39:50.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.517" end="00:39:50.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know?</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.217" end="00:39:51.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some of it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.717" end="00:39:52.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you look into me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.617" end="00:39:53.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to know who&#39;s coming into my</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.617" end="00:39:54.117" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.117" end="00:39:54.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After hearing me like that just now</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.117" end="00:39:55.817" style="s2">aren&#39;t you put off?</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.917" end="00:39:56.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather see you like that than watch</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.817" end="00:39:57.017" style="s2">you pretend you don&#39;t care about</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.617" end="00:39:58.017" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.017" end="00:39:58.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you prefer it when I show my claws</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.017" end="00:39:59.517" style="s2">and fight back?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.617" end="00:40:00.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So far there&#39;s nothing about you I</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.517" end="00:40:01.817" style="s2">dislike.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.317" end="00:40:02.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.817" end="00:40:03.717" style="s2">They withdraw their investment because</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.717" end="00:40:04.617" style="s2">of the partner review? I spent months</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.717" end="00:40:05.617" style="s2">preparing for this. This mattered far</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.617" end="00:40:06.717" style="s2">more than that launch. Funding, retail</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.617" end="00:40:08.217" style="s2">channels, connections, all gone. What</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.717" end="00:40:09.117" style="s2">did I do wrong? Lewis again? No. No one</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.217" end="00:40:10.117" style="s2">knows about this project. If he wants</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.117" end="00:40:12.717" style="s2">revenge he can make up anything. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.117" end="00:40:12.717" style="s2">hear how he explains some</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.317" end="00:40:20.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, what exactly are you trying to do?</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.417" end="00:40:24.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.217" end="00:40:25.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The investors pulled out today. Did you</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.017" end="00:40:26.317" style="s2">go behind my back and tell them about</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.117" end="00:40:27.817" style="s2">what happened before? This isn&#39;t some</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.317" end="00:40:29.517" style="s2">game after a breakup. You&#39;re ruining my</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.817" end="00:40:31.217" style="s2">business. Being clueless is one thing,</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.517" end="00:40:32.317" style="s2">deliberately hurting someone is another.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.217" end="00:40:33.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lost your investment and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.317" end="00:40:35.217" style="s2">blaming me? If your car won&#39;t start</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.817" end="00:40:36.717" style="s2">tomorrow will that be my fault too? Find</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.217" end="00:40:38.617" style="s2">someone else to blame. Hardly anyone</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.717" end="00:40:39.817" style="s2">knew about it. My team, Vivian and you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.617" end="00:40:41.217" style="s2">Maybe he mentioned it but I&#39;m not here</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.817" end="00:40:43.117" style="s2">to keep track of his business plans.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.217" end="00:40:44.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s right here beside me, yet Evans</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.117" end="00:40:47.017" style="s2">still has all his attention.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.917" end="00:40:47.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.117" end="00:40:53.718" style="s2">The The slipped. I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.418" end="00:40:55.518" style="s2">His hand is so warm.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.718" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">And he suddenly feels so close.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.518" end="00:41:00.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, should I pull over somewhere?</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:04.518" style="s2">Find a safe place.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.418" end="00:41:07.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was that just now? Who are you with?</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.518" end="00:41:07.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your ex is waiting for an answer.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.518" end="00:41:11.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is he doing?</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.118" end="00:41:13.418" style="s2">Not now. I can&#39;t let Evan hear me lose</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.818" end="00:41:14.618" style="s2">my composure.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.418" end="00:41:15.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, are you listening?</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.618" end="00:41:15.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.218" end="00:41:17.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.718" end="00:41:18.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully. Your business deal is</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.318" end="00:41:20.018" style="s2">ruined and I don&#39;t feel sorry for you,</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.918" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">but I didn&#39;t do it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.018" end="00:41:22.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me who you&#39;re with.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:24.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re broken up. When I asked you that</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.918" end="00:41:27.418" style="s2">before, you told me to mind my own</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.018" end="00:41:28.718" style="s2">business. Now I&#39;m saying it back to you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.418" end="00:41:29.718" style="s2">Now it&#39;s your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.718" end="00:41:31.518" style="s2">What was that just now?</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.718" end="00:41:33.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got startled just now, so I moved a</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.518" end="00:41:34.518" style="s2">little closer.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.218" end="00:41:36.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the way to my ear?</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.518" end="00:41:37.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have told me to move away.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.418" end="00:41:38.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t tell you to move away. Were you</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.818" end="00:41:40.618" style="s2">jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.918" end="00:41:42.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.618" end="00:41:46.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine now. You can let go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.918" end="00:41:49.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your fingers are still trembling.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.118" end="00:41:49.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hold it myself. So can I.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.318" end="00:41:56.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you usually work this late?</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.518" end="00:41:59.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Depends. Lately, leaving early would</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.318" end="00:41:59.418" style="s2">already be unusual.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.518" end="00:42:03.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you like for dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.118" end="00:42:06.518" style="s2">Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.818" end="00:42:09.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.518" end="00:42:11.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm?</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.718" end="00:42:15.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His hand is so warm.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.818" end="00:42:15.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes things much easier.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.418" end="00:42:20.518" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you so bold just a moment ago?</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.918" end="00:42:22.318" style="s2">Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.518" end="00:42:24.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a little tight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.318" end="00:42:25.918" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t hurt. It just</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.218" end="00:42:27.518" style="s2">feels different.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.918" end="00:42:29.918" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t usually look at me like that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.518" end="00:42:31.118" style="s2">I can barely think straight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.918" end="00:42:33.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you&#39;re acting like you didn&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.118" end="00:42:33.518" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.918" end="00:42:39.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still so warm.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.318" end="00:42:44.818" style="s2">Is that I used to only see cars like</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.018" end="00:42:46.218" style="s2">this through showroom windows. Now</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.818" end="00:42:48.218" style="s2">there&#39;s actually one parked here,</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.218" end="00:42:49.818" style="s2">waiting for me. Just look at this car,</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.218" end="00:42:51.320" style="s2">the paintwork and the craftsmanship</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.818" end="00:42:53.920" style="s2">inside. Coming. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.320" end="00:42:53.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; be right there.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.720" end="00:43:00.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one more minute.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.420" end="00:43:02.320" style="s2">This car is really mine?</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.820" end="00:43:03.920" style="s2">Feels like a dream.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.320" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to make him happy. At least I</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.920" end="00:43:07.120" style="s2">managed that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.620" end="00:43:09.820" style="s2">I just didn&#39;t expect to rank below a</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.120" end="00:43:11.420" style="s2">dashboard in Noah&#39;s eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.820" end="00:43:12.920" style="s2">Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.420" end="00:43:14.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me look at one more thing.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.920" end="00:43:16.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I&#39;ll have to come and invite</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.020" end="00:43:16.820" style="s2">you to dinner myself.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.020" end="00:43:21.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know where the elevator is.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.120" end="00:43:23.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you haven&#39;t been walking that way.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.920" end="00:43:24.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.020" end="00:43:24.820" style="s2">I just haven&#39;t had enough of looking at</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.020" end="00:43:25.920" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.820" end="00:43:27.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I have dinner sent to the back</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.920" end="00:43:28.020" style="s2">seat?</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.020" end="00:43:30.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could eat first. You don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.020" end="00:43:32.920" style="s2">wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.120" end="00:43:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your solution?</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.120" end="00:43:38.620" style="s2">If you keep trying to brush me off, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.820" end="00:43:38.620" style="s2">going to kiss you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.120" end="00:43:43.220" style="s2">What are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.320" end="00:43:44.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll behave for a little while.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.220" end="00:43:45.320" style="s2">Eating in the car actually sounds pretty</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.920" end="00:43:46.420" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.320" end="00:43:47.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still thinking about it. What are</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.420" end="00:43:48.520" style="s2">you smiling at?</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.120" end="00:43:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The seats are comfortable and the sound</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.520" end="00:43:50.520" style="s2">system&#39;s great. I could stay in there</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.920" end="00:43:51.320" style="s2">all night.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.520" end="00:43:52.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that car?</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.320" end="00:43:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really is jealous of a car.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.820" end="00:43:54.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not seriously competing with</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.520" end="00:43:55.620" style="s2">something you gave me, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.420" end="00:43:56.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That depends on which of us you&#39;d rather</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.620" end="00:43:57.120" style="s2">spend the night with.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.520" end="00:43:58.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.120" end="00:43:58.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car didn&#39;t offer to take me to</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.020" end="00:43:59.320" style="s2">dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.320" end="00:44:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll talk about that later.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.320" end="00:44:02.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just trying to make you feel better.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.320" end="00:44:03.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Finally sitting down. Maybe things</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.320" end="00:44:04.920" style="s2">can be normal for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.320" end="00:44:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lemon roast chicken, mushroom beef, and</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.920" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">vegetable soup. The sauces are served</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.320" end="00:44:07.820" style="s2">separately.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.720" end="00:44:09.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, that smells amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.820" end="00:44:10.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fresh from the oven, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.320" end="00:44:11.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there anything you&#39;d like changed?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.420" end="00:44:12.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We won&#39;t need to go out for dinner</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.320" end="00:44:14.320" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.620" end="00:44:15.420" style="s2">It&#39;s great here. Your chef really knows</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.320" end="00:44:17.020" style="s2">what he&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.420" end="00:44:18.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then come here for dinner every day.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.020" end="00:44:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.220" end="00:44:20.520" style="s2">What did I just agree to?</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.720" end="00:44:21.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it&#39;s settled.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.520" end="00:44:23.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And all this time I thought I was the</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.620" end="00:44:25.320" style="s2">one setting traps in this relationship.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.620" end="00:44:27.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been almost 20 years. I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.320" end="00:44:27.720" style="s2">seen him forget about work so completely</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.020" end="00:44:29.720" style="s2">during a meal.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.720" end="00:44:30.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is really good. Julian, he really</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.720" end="00:44:32.520" style="s2">knows how to pick his mom.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.720" end="00:44:34.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have Elliot arrange it. Okay. When are</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.520" end="00:44:35.620" style="s2">you leaving? Julian calls him about work</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.120" end="00:44:37.120" style="s2">while I&#39;m sitting here invited to come</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.620" end="00:44:38.820" style="s2">to dinner every day from now on. Better</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:42.020" style="s2">not point out the difference. Another</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.820" end="00:44:42.820" style="s2">call. I should let him get on with it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.020" end="00:44:44.120" style="s2">Where&#39;s the data?</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.820" end="00:44:45.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t even keep these calls private</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.120" end="00:44:47.320" style="s2">for me. That quote won&#39;t work.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.820" end="00:44:47.520" style="s2">Renegotiate using the numbers I gave</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.320" end="00:44:48.820" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.520" end="00:44:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really had his fun when I was on the</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.820" end="00:44:52.520" style="s2">phone. Now it&#39;s my turn to get even.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.720" end="00:44:55.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When does their team meet? Tell Harold</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.520" end="00:44:55.521" style="s2">to go over there next week.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.321" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">[snorts] Let&#39;s see how focused you</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.621" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">really are.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.521" end="00:45:05.221" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll leave you to it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.521" end="00:45:12.221" style="s2">Send the revised quote to my email. No</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.621" end="00:45:12.221" style="s2">reaction? Fine. I&#39;ll try again.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.661" end="00:45:19.921" style="s2">[sighs and gasps] Okay, he reacted. Time</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.621" end="00:45:19.921" style="s2">to guard</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.121" end="00:45:24.421" style="s2">Those are our terms. If you can&#39;t accept</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.321" end="00:45:24.421" style="s2">them, we&#39;ll find another partner.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.121" end="00:45:30.621" style="s2">I just wanted to see what the sample</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.421" end="00:45:32.521" style="s2">smells like near your skin.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.621" end="00:45:33.821" style="s2">You&#39;re taking this so seriously. I</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.521" end="00:45:35.921" style="s2">should give you my full attention.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.821" end="00:45:39.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m serious. A scent smells different on</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.921" end="00:45:42.521" style="s2">paper than it does on skin.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.121" end="00:45:44.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll give you a proper answer.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.521" end="00:45:45.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How exactly are you going to answer?</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.121" end="00:45:47.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew exactly what you were doing</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.921" end="00:45:48.521" style="s2">just now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.521" end="00:45:50.221" style="s2">You were the one who provoked me in the</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.521" end="00:45:52.821" style="s2">car first.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.221" end="00:45:54.021" style="s2">So it&#39;s still my fault?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.821" end="00:45:56.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think I took it too far.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.021" end="00:45:56.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay right here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.321" end="00:46:03.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he really going to do it?</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.821" end="00:46:04.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I You&#39;re blushing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.121" end="00:46:06.751" style="s2">It&#39;s a little warm in here. He&#39;s too</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.521" end="00:46:08.771" style="s2">close. That&#39;s the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.751" end="00:46:08.771" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.021" end="00:46:14.821" style="s2">So I&#39;m not the only one whose heart is</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.421" end="00:46:15.922" style="s2">racing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.821" end="00:46:16.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you trying now?</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.922" end="00:46:17.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.221" end="00:46:18.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your pulse. You&#39;re not as calm as you</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.921" end="00:46:19.921" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.721" end="00:46:21.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, do you want me to kiss you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.921" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not joking this time. At first I</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.521" end="00:46:24.921" style="s2">only wanted him to fall for me. Now he</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.321" end="00:46:27.321" style="s2">means it, and I want this kiss just as</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.921" end="00:46:29.121" style="s2">much. A year and a half, a $500,000</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.321" end="00:46:30.821" style="s2">investment, enough to get the product</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.121" end="00:46:33.321" style="s2">into stores and really build my company,</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.821" end="00:46:36.321" style="s2">and now it&#39;s gone, just like that.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.321" end="00:46:37.421" style="s2">No, I need to find out why.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.321" end="00:46:37.821" style="s2">Mr. Clark, I&#39;m sorry to bother you this</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.421" end="00:46:38.421" style="s2">late.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.821" end="00:46:39.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evan.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.421" end="00:46:40.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I received the notice about the</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.321" end="00:46:41.421" style="s2">withdrawal of funding. What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.521" end="00:46:42.321" style="s2">You said the early sales figures were</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.421" end="00:46:44.221" style="s2">very good.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.321" end="00:46:45.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They were, but this decision concerns</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.221" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">the partner, not those figures.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.721" end="00:46:47.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then please tell me where I failed. What</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:48.921" style="s2">exactly did I do?</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.721" end="00:46:50.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look beyond business plans. We also look</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.921" end="00:46:51.521" style="s2">at how operators treat others and handle</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.221" end="00:46:52.821" style="s2">problems. We verified what happened at</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.521" end="00:46:53.921" style="s2">the showcase. You interrupted the event,</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.821" end="00:46:55.221" style="s2">took a participant&#39;s phone, and kept</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.921" end="00:46:55.721" style="s2">puncering them. Afterward, you lost your</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.221" end="00:46:56.021" style="s2">launch slot.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.721" end="00:46:57.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.021" end="00:46:58.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re entrusting you with our funds and</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.221" end="00:46:59.323" style="s2">other people&#39;s work. If a private</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.223" end="00:46:59.622" style="s2">dispute can make you act like that in</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.323" end="00:47:00.523" style="s2">public,</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.622" end="00:47:01.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t heard the whole story.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.523" end="00:47:02.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand you see it differently, but</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.823" end="00:47:03.922" style="s2">we need to trust both the product and</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.922" end="00:47:04.922" style="s2">the person we&#39;re partnering with. That</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.922" end="00:47:05.723" style="s2">is non-negotiable.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.922" end="00:47:07.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did someone report me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.723" end="00:47:09.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Project manager Claire Evans. No one</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.422" end="00:47:10.323" style="s2">contacted us to report you. We gathered</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.023" end="00:47:10.723" style="s2">this information during a routine</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.323" end="00:47:11.723" style="s2">review.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.723" end="00:47:13.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Evans, surely there must be</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.723" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; explained the reasons for the decision.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.223" end="00:47:15.323" style="s2">That&#39;s all I can say tonight. I hope</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.422" end="00:47:15.723" style="s2">your next partnership goes more</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.323" end="00:47:17.523" style="s2">smoothly.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.723" end="00:47:18.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Routine review? Why now of all times? A</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.523" end="00:47:19.422" style="s2">few days earlier, none of this would</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.523" end="00:47:20.622" style="s2">have happened. Lewis knows so many</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.422" end="00:47:21.723" style="s2">people in this industry. He wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.622" end="00:47:22.922" style="s2">even have to report me to get all this</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:24.323" style="s2">in front of the investors. Costing me</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.922" end="00:47:25.223" style="s2">the launch slot wasn&#39;t enough, now this.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.323" end="00:47:26.723" style="s2">I need to find a way to make them</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.223" end="00:47:28.023" style="s2">reconsider.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.723" end="00:47:28.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Evans.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.023" end="00:47:29.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.422" end="00:47:31.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The joint proposal is due tomorrow. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.922" end="00:47:32.422" style="s2">already uploaded the promotional images,</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.323" end="00:47:33.223" style="s2">but your sales section isn&#39;t in the</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.422" end="00:47:34.422" style="s2">folder yet. What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.223" end="00:47:35.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s still a little left to do. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.422" end="00:47:36.122" style="s2">send it to you before 5:00 tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.523" end="00:47:36.922" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.122" end="00:47:38.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know this company. Although it</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.922" end="00:47:39.223" style="s2">operates independently, it belongs to an</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.023" end="00:47:39.523" style="s2">investment business under Adrian Wade.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.223" end="00:47:40.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; company?</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.523" end="00:47:41.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. That makes things much easier.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.823" end="00:47:42.323" style="s2">If Adrian gets them to reconsider,</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.922" end="00:47:43.523" style="s2">they&#39;ll listen.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.323" end="00:47:44.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, thank you. I owe you for this.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.523" end="00:47:45.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful. I might remember you said that.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.723" end="00:47:47.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name your price. I&#39;ll do whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.622" end="00:47:49.023" style="s2">need. Contact the investment team. Have</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.622" end="00:47:49.922" style="s2">them review Evans&#39;s project again and</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.023" end="00:47:52.723" style="s2">reinstate the funding.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.922" end="00:47:54.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll ask. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.723" end="00:47:55.323" style="s2">I contacted the person in charge. There</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.323" end="00:47:56.122" style="s2">are a few issues.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.323" end="00:47:57.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.122" end="00:47:58.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The reason for the rejection is already</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.223" end="00:47:59.223" style="s2">on file. Other teams will see why they</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.323" end="00:48:00.122" style="s2">withdrew the investment. Giving them</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.223" end="00:48:00.422" style="s2">your name won&#39;t make that record</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.122" end="00:48:01.323" style="s2">disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.422" end="00:48:02.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me the project manager&#39;s number. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.323" end="00:48:03.922" style="s2">speak to her myself.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.323" end="00:48:05.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cross, what can I do for you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.922" end="00:48:06.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want Evans&#39;s investment reinstated.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.323" end="00:48:08.323" style="s2">Make an exception for him.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.223" end="00:48:10.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We manage other people&#39;s money. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.323" end="00:48:12.122" style="s2">pretend a failed review never happened</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.323" end="00:48:12.323" style="s2">just because a brand ambassador asks us</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.122" end="00:48:13.823" style="s2">to.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.323" end="00:48:15.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll go straight to Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.823" end="00:48:16.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you can.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.422" end="00:48:18.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me guess what I&#39;m about to say</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.323" end="00:48:18.823" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.122" end="00:48:23.223" style="s2">You distracted me plenty while I was on</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.523" end="00:48:23.223" style="s2">the phone, too.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.323" end="00:48:28.323" style="s2">Julian.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.622" end="00:48:30.422" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you two just speak on the phone?</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.323" end="00:48:31.422" style="s2">Seriously? Right now?</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.422" end="00:48:33.023" style="s2">You&#39;ve given him enough of your</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.422" end="00:48:34.323" style="s2">attention already.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.023" end="00:48:37.323" style="s2">You look like you&#39;re having a hard time</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.323" end="00:48:37.323" style="s2">making a decision.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.122" end="00:48:41.422" style="s2">You don&#39;t want me to answer it?</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.122" end="00:48:42.622" style="s2">I just like watching you choose to stay</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.422" end="00:48:43.922" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.622" end="00:48:46.523" style="s2">It&#39;s ringing again.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:46.523" style="s2">See who it is.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.223" end="00:48:52.223" style="s2">A business partner. Then answer it.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.622" end="00:48:52.223" style="s2">You take care of it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.023" end="00:49:03.924" style="s2">Get a grip. It just a kiss.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.524" end="00:49:10.124" style="s2">I still have the sample report to</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.624" end="00:49:10.124" style="s2">finish.</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.669" end="00:49:21.124" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.124" end="00:49:22.524" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.124" end="00:49:24.324" style="s2">He&#39;s busy working. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.524" end="00:49:25.824" style="s2">Promotions, events, overseas trips. I</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.324" end="00:49:27.524" style="s2">only had to ask and someone would always</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.824" end="00:49:28.724" style="s2">arrange everything. It&#39;s late. Evan&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.524" end="00:49:31.224" style="s2">the one in a hurry. That doesn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.724" end="00:49:31.224" style="s2">Adrian is.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.024" end="00:49:35.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that one of the cars in Vale&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.324" end="00:49:38.624" style="s2">private fleet?</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.824" end="00:49:38.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian&#39;s car?</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.124" end="00:49:42.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your car.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.524" end="00:49:44.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.824" end="00:49:45.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been seeing Nail all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.624" end="00:49:46.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I invited him.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.324" end="00:49:48.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know exactly what he&#39;s after. He</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.824" end="00:49:48.324" style="s2">wants your money, wants you to protect</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.124" end="00:49:50.124" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.324" end="00:49:51.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My private life is not yours to manage.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.124" end="00:49:52.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then help Evan. One call from you and it</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.924" end="00:49:54.224" style="s2">can all be fixed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.724" end="00:49:55.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve already given their answer. You</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.224" end="00:49:56.524" style="s2">can&#39;t use my name to get them to change</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.624" end="00:49:57.724" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.524" end="00:49:58.624" style="s2">And the credit on Noah&#39;s work needs to</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.724" end="00:50:00.324" style="s2">be corrected.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.624" end="00:50:03.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because he&#39;s with you?</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.324" end="00:50:03.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because he made it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.324" end="00:50:08.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked me for the finished formula. I</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:10.124" style="s2">sent it to you. On the next version,</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.624" end="00:50:11.824" style="s2">Julian&#39;s name was on it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.124" end="00:50:12.924" style="s2">I found the buyers. I made the sales</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.824" end="00:50:13.724" style="s2">plan. Without me, you couldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.924" end="00:50:15.824" style="s2">gotten it out there.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.724" end="00:50:17.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You handle sales. I handle development.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.824" end="00:50:18.724" style="s2">Those are two different jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.024" end="00:50:20.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The records match the samples and the</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.724" end="00:50:21.324" style="s2">revisions are his, too. There&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.124" end="00:50:21.924" style="s2">reason to list someone else as the</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.324" end="00:50:23.324" style="s2">perfumer.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.924" end="00:50:23.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People are interested because my name is</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.324" end="00:50:24.724" style="s2">on it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.724" end="00:50:26.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then put your name under brand</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.724" end="00:50:28.024" style="s2">ambassador. Leave mine under perfumer.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.624" end="00:50:29.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The product page and launch materials</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.024" end="00:50:30.424" style="s2">will be corrected. The correction notice</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.324" end="00:50:30.924" style="s2">will make clear that Noah is the</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.424" end="00:50:32.124" style="s2">creator.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.924" end="00:50:33.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The promotional cot wasn&#39;t meant to</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.124" end="00:50:33.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I guess you&#39;ll say this wasn&#39;t what it</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.224" end="00:50:35.224" style="s2">meant, either.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.924" end="00:50:36.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve already notified your company.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.224" end="00:50:37.724" style="s2">Someone else will handle this</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.024" end="00:50:38.424" style="s2">partnership. Do not contact Noah about</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.724" end="00:50:40.624" style="s2">this matter again.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.424" end="00:50:42.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really cutting me out completely?</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.624" end="00:50:44.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only taking back my own work. What</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.324" end="00:50:46.824" style="s2">you do next is your business.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.024" end="00:50:48.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. $70,000. Satisfied now?</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.824" end="00:50:50.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That settles my past work.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.524" end="00:50:51.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all this, you should remember who</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.424" end="00:50:53.424" style="s2">gave you a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.724" end="00:50:54.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did the work and you made money. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.424" end="00:50:55.924" style="s2">even.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.624" end="00:50:58.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s finally my name.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:50:59.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It always should have been.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.524" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re scent. It&#39;s becoming more</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.524" end="00:51:01.924" style="s2">noticeable.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.424" end="00:51:04.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My pheromones are beginning to develop</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.924" end="00:51:05.225" style="s2">again. It&#39;s a second differentiation.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.025" end="00:51:07.025" style="s2">Before I met you, I couldn&#39;t smell</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.225" end="00:51:08.525" style="s2">anyone&#39;s pheromones. Even now, I still</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.025" end="00:51:10.225" style="s2">can&#39;t smell anyone else&#39;s. Did my</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.525" end="00:51:12.325" style="s2">pheromones cause this change in you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.225" end="00:51:13.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.325" end="00:51:14.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s why you&#39;ve kept asking me to</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.625" end="00:51:15.825" style="s2">stay?</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.125" end="00:51:17.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your scent caught my attention.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.825" end="00:51:18.925" style="s2">But scent isn&#39;t why I watched your work</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.025" end="00:51:20.125" style="s2">video 20 times. I like how smart you</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.925" end="00:51:21.525" style="s2">are. I like that you won&#39;t be bullied.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.125" end="00:51:22.925" style="s2">Even when you argue with me, I like</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.525" end="00:51:24.525" style="s2">being with you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.925" end="00:51:25.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why I want you to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.525" end="00:51:27.325" style="s2">At first, I wanted to find someone they</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.925" end="00:51:29.525" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t dare bully.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.325" end="00:51:31.725" style="s2">Someone who could protect me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.525" end="00:51:33.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.725" end="00:51:35.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, that&#39;s not why I&#39;m staying.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.925" end="00:51:36.625" style="s2">I want to be with you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.225" end="00:51:37.525" style="s2">I also want to keep pursuing my own</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.625" end="00:51:39.625" style="s2">career.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.525" end="00:51:41.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know how much your work means to you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.625" end="00:51:44.825" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking you to give it up.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.525" end="00:51:44.825" style="s2">I want you to feel at home here, too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.125" end="00:51:50.225" style="s2">Put it there. I still need those.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.925" end="00:51:53.725" style="s2">Your scent is stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.225" end="00:51:58.125" style="s2">It used to fade almost immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.525" end="00:51:59.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did it make you uncomfortable?</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.125" end="00:52:01.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.325" end="00:52:01.625" style="s2">Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.825" end="00:52:07.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You even stop working.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.625" end="00:52:07.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy it. You&#39;ve got about 10 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.325" end="00:52:15.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take these away to make room for</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.625" end="00:52:17.725" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.025" end="00:52:17.725" style="s2">There&#39;s still room over there.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.025" end="00:52:20.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to stay?</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.425" end="00:52:23.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you don&#39;t talk my ear off</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.525" end="00:52:23.525" style="s2">while I&#39;m writing my report.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.525" end="00:52:38.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re running a fever again.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.425" end="00:52:41.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These episodes have been lasting longer.</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.525" end="00:52:43.225" style="s2">I&#39;ll go for another checkup tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.825" end="00:52:44.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re worried.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.225" end="00:52:48.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what&#39;s going to happen</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.425" end="00:52:48.125" style="s2">next. I&#39;m not used to this.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.925" end="00:52:51.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go with you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.525" end="00:52:59.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let me make you late for work.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.525" end="00:53:00.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve moved my appointments. The studio</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.925" end="00:53:02.925" style="s2">knows.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.925" end="00:53:04.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can handle a checkup.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.925" end="00:53:04.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you can. I &#39;m coming anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.725" end="00:53:06.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The car</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.927" end="00:53:07.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is ready, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.527" end="00:53:09.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;d like to keep you overnight while</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.627" end="00:53:10.127" style="s2">these changes settle. If you feel worse,</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.027" end="00:53:11.227" style="s2">press the call button.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.127" end="00:53:12.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still hot a little?</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.227" end="00:53:13.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to watch me every second.</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.127" end="00:53:14.327" style="s2">I usually know what to do next day while</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.227" end="00:53:15.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You looked worried. I&#39;m staying close.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.327" end="00:53:18.527" style="s2">Tonight you rest. We let them do their</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.827" end="00:53:18.527" style="s2">job. I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.927" end="00:53:28.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your pheromones have fully developed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.927" end="00:53:28.427" style="s2">Everything remained stable last night.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.427" end="00:53:34.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s complete?</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.727" end="00:53:37.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.727" end="00:53:41.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can go home today. The nurse will</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.727" end="00:53:41.527" style="s2">bring you the discharge instructions.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.827" end="00:53:47.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you smell anyone else&#39;s pheromones</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.727" end="00:53:49.127" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.427" end="00:53:51.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.127" end="00:53:54.127" style="s2">Still only yours.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.427" end="00:53:56.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not so hot now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.127" end="00:53:59.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feel better about taking me home now?</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.527" end="00:53:59.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.927" end="00:54:05.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is your neck sore?</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.427" end="00:54:07.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That chair isn&#39;t exactly comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.627" end="00:54:11.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chair on some folds.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.827" end="00:54:12.727" style="s2">Sit for a while. I&#39;ll pack the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.027" end="00:54:15.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one being discharged today?</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.727" end="00:54:15.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can carry a bag.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.927" end="00:54:21.727" style="s2">Ready to go?</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.227" end="00:54:21.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.127" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You changed the opening. It was too</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.527" end="00:54:35.927" style="s2">sharp. The calming formula stays the</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:37.827" style="s2">same. This is easier to wear.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.927" end="00:54:39.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.827" end="00:54:43.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I film this one too?</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.427" end="00:54:43.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Get the name in focus.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.727" end="00:54:49.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need another hour.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.827" end="00:54:51.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.327" end="00:54:53.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have work too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.727" end="00:54:54.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I moved a meeting. I can finish the rest</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.327" end="00:54:56.127" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.427" end="00:54:59.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really don&#39;t mind waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.127" end="00:54:59.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like watching you work. You know that.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.427" end="00:55:07.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready?</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.927" end="00:55:07.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready. I&#39;m Noah Reed. I created this</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.127" end="00:55:08.428" style="s2">perfume.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.927" end="00:55:09.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You looked right at</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.428" end="00:55:10.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; home up there.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.128" end="00:55:10.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Took me long enough to get my own name</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.328" end="00:55:11.928" style="s2">on it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.728" end="00:55:14.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one&#39;s taking it off again.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.928" end="00:55:16.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn right. In the movie, this story was</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.128" end="00:55:17.128" style="s2">supposed to end with my death. I like</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.028" end="00:55:17.828" style="s2">this ending much better.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.128" end="00:55:18.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that look for?</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.828" end="00:55:19.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was thinking about dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.628" end="00:55:20.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you like?</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.128" end="00:55:22.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking you out. My treat.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.228" end="00:55:22.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then lead the way.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
